<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Bhaamuzi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Bhaamuzi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bhaamuzi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bhaa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bhaamuzi</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chenjenu cha ihongozi chechilohakeka Bhatemula nde malandilu gha chikahi cha ulandilu wa ghaghajengalli baada ja Bhaizilaeli kujilapula na kujitola inchi ja Kanaani. Chakabhili nde chikahi cha kuhenga mahakau chechajengaliwi na chikahi cha ulali, mang'ahiku, kulimbalakiwa, na bhela kukengalewa. Chikahi chenihechi Bhaizilaeli bhakatumbwili kujojabhela imong'umong'u, na bhela Chapanga akaghakwehiki mataifa ghangi kubhalimbalakila Bhaizilaeli. Baada ja panihapa bhandu bhakunkelabhukili na kundelela Chapanga, na panihapa Chapanga akabhahawile ihongozi bhabhakalowakiki “Bhatemula,” nahuli kubhalongoha bhandu na kubhabhoha mu utumwa wa kubhonewa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Njeta mundu jokapi jola joamanyi kwa uchakaka kubha nde nane joakachilembiki chitabu cha bhatemula. Bhandu bhamaheli kwa kujengalela majopalelu Fulani bhakaholakili kubha mlota Samweli nde joakachilembike, nambu tuweza kubha na uchakaka nakanopi kubha chakalembakiki mu chikahi ambachu Bhaizilaeli bhakabhi tayali bhabhili na nkolongwa, kwa kubha chitabu chilolakela kunyuma na kupwagha kubhokana na ikahi ya Bhatemula kubha ikahi yela Bhaizilaeli ngachebhakabhili na nkolongwa 17:6; 18:1; 19:1, na 21:25. Anangati chikahi cha Bhaizilaeli kubhoka kuhuma ku Misili chakabhi ngati mu chaka cha 1400 K. K (Ulolakyaje ulongulelu wa Kubhoka kwa malobhi nakanope), bhela iwezikana matukiu gha Bhatemula ghakapitalili pachilanda ja hyaka 1300 mbaka 1050 K. K chikahi ambachu Sauli paakabhili nkolongwa wa Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Ngondo ya kujomukela pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli na Bhakanaani baada ja nyiwa jaka Yoshua. Bhelabhela chihoghola lipazia kutambulisha chikahi cha Bhatemula pala Chapanga paakabhakwehiki ihongozi bhabhakalongwihi na kubhakengalela Bhaizilaeli kuhuma mu mabhoku gha adui bhabhu (Sula 1 mbaka 3:6).</para>
  <para style="io">Bhatemula patali patali bhabhakwehakiki na Chapanga kubhajangatila Bhaizilaeli. (Sula 3:7 mbaka 16:31).</para>
  <para style="io">Mahakau ghangi ghabhakahengiki Bhaizilaeli. (Sula 17 mbaka 21).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Bhandu bha lkabila laka Yuda na Simeoni bhunkamula nkolongwa Adonibezeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Bhela paakapoti Yoshua, Bhaizilaeli bhakundalukili Bambo Chapanga, “Bho, likabila bholi leanalilongulyaje kukwela palongi jitu nahuli kukomana na Bhakanaani?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Bambo Chapanga akayangike, “Likabila la Yuda nde leanalilongulyaje, maghambu nijibhekiki inchi jeniheji pahi ja lujiniku lwabhu.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Panihapa bhandu bha likabila laka Yuda bhakabhapwaghi bhalongu bhabhu bhandu bha likabila laka Simioni, “Mkwelaje papamu na tepani mu inchi jetupekiwi, nahuli tupata kukomana na Bhakanaani. Tepani natatu anatujenda papamu na mwehapa mu pandu pinu pampekiwi.” Bhela Bhasimioni bhakapiti papamu nabhu. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Henu bhandu bha likabila laka Yuda bhakapiti kukomana, Bambo Chapanga akabhabhekiki Bhakanaani, na Bhapelezi pahi ja lujiniku lwabhu, nabhombi bhakabhakomiki bhandu elufu komi ku Bezeki hoku. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Konihoku nde kobhakunhimanili nkolongwa Adoni Bezeki, bhakakomini naku na kubhaweza Bhakanaani na Bhapelizi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Nkolongwa Adoni Bezeki akatiliki, nambu bhakunjengalili na kunkamula, bhakunhekiti ngonji ikolongwa ya mumawoku na mumawolu. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Nkolongwa Adoni Bezeki akapwaghike, “Chapanga anapwili maghambu pakutumbula hapa nakabhakamwili bhakolongwa sabini na kubhaheketa ngonji ya mumabhoku na mumagholu na kubhajomalakela kula imbala pahi ja meza jangu. Henu Chapanga anepiki ghangani, ngati ghala ghanakabhatendile.” Bhakumpeliki ku Yelusalemu, najombi akapotili konihoku.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bha likabila laka Yuda bhabhaweza bhandu bha Yerusalem na Hebron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Yuda bhakakomini na bhandu bha ku Yelusalemu, na kuutola mateka. Bhakabhakomiki bhandu bhaki kwa mapanga na kuujocha muchi hoghu kwa moto. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Panihapa bhandu bha likabila laka Yuda bhakapiti kukomana na Bhakanaani bhabhatamikaje mu inchi ja itombi, pandu pajomu ku upambala wa kunkache, na pandu pa uwanda ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Bhela bhandu bhaka Yuda bhakakomini na Bhakanaani bhabhatamikaje mu Hebuloni ambaju pamwandi hapa ukalowakiki Kiliati Aliba, na konihoku akaiweziki ngolu ya Sheshai, Ahimani, na Talimai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otinieli na manjolinjoli ghaki abhaweza bhandu bha muchi wa Debili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JOS 15:13-19">Yoshua 15:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Kuhuma ku Hebuloni bhandu bha likabila laka Yuda bhakapiti kukomana na bhandu bha muchi wa Debili, ambau pamwandi hapa ukalowakiki Kiliati Sefeli. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Panihapa Kalebu akatangize, “Mundu jokapi jola joanawezaje kuulapula na kuutola mateka muchi wa Kiliati Sefeli, ananuntoghukyaje mwali wangu Akisa akubha nhwanu wake.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Bhela Otinieli, mwana waka Kenazi, nnung'una waki Kalebu, akautoliki mateka muchi ghonihoghu, najombi Kalebu akumbohiki mwali waki Akisa atoghulikaje na Otinieli. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Mu lichobha labhu la ndowa, Akisa akapiti kulobha ngonda kwaka Kalebu, tati waki. Panihapa Akisa akahulwiki kuhuma panani ja liponda laki, na Kalebu akundalukile, “Bho, upala nukupekya kike?” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Akisa akayangike, “Umbekya mhupu. Kwa kubha umbekihi ngonda ku pandu pajomu ku upambala wa kunkache, nukulobha umbekyaje na pandu papabhili na mikolulela bhelabhela.” Bhela Kalebu akumpekihi chemichemi ya machi ya kundonda, na mikolulela ya machi ya pahi.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makabila gha Yuda na Benyamini ghaweza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Bhabhelakeka bhaka Mkeni, joakabhili nkowanu waka Musa, bhakakweliki papamu na bhandu bha likabila laka Yuda kuhuma mu muchi wa mitende, yani muchi wa Yeliko, mbaka ku lipololu la Yuda, pambipi na upambala wa kunkache ja muchi wa Aladi. Bhakabhekiki matamu ghabhu konihoku papamu na bhandu bhaka Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Bhela bhandu bha likabila laka Yuda bhakajangatini na bhalongu bhabhu, yani bhandu bha likabila laka Simeoni, kubhaweza Bhakanaani bhabhatamika ku Sefati. Bhakauyoningi muchi ghonihoghu, na kuung'anambula lihina kubha Holima. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Papamu na ghanihagha likabila laka Yuda bhakautoliki mateka muchi wa Gaza papamu na malindakanilu ghaki, Ashikeloni papamu na malindakanilu ghaki, na Ekiloni papamu na malindakanilu ghaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Bambo Chapanga akabhajangatili bhandu bha likabila laka Yuda. Nabhombi bhakajitoliki mateka inchi ja itombi. Nambu ngachebhakaweziki kubhatopola bhandu bhanihabha bhabhatamikaje mu libondi leniheli, kwa kubha bhombi bhakabhili na magali gha choma ghaghahutakikaje kwa falasi. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Muchi wa Hebuloni akapekiwi Kalebu, ngati moakalaghalaki Musa. Kalebu akabhatopwili ngolu itatu ya bhana bhaka Anaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Nambu bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini ngachebhatopwili Bhayebusi bhabhakabhi bhatama ku muchi wa Yelusalemu, nde ndandi Bhayebusi bhatama papamu na bhandu bha likabila la Benyamini mkati ja muchi wa Yelusalemu mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bha likabila laka Efulaimu na Manase bhauteka muchi wa Betheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Bhandu bha makabila ghaka Yusufu, yani likabila laka Efulaimu na Manase, bhakapiti kuulapula muchi wa Beseli, najombi Bambo Chapanga akabhajangatili. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Bhakabhatumiki hoti bhandu kujenda kuupeleleza muchi wa Beseli. Muchi ghonihoghu pamwandi hapa ukalowakiki Luzu. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Bhapelelezi bhanihabha bhakumbweni mundu jumu ahuma mu muchi ghonihoghu, bhakumpwaghile, “Chondi, utulangihaje indela ja kujingalila mu muchi, na tepani anatukuleka womi.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Akabhalangihi indela ja kujingalila mu muchi, bhela bhakajingili na kunjonanga kila mundu joakabhi monihomu. Nambu bhakundekiki womi mundu jola, papamu na bhandu bha munyumba jaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Mundu jonihoju akapiti mbaka ku inchi ja Bhahiti, konihoku akauchengiki muchi ambau akaulohiki Luzu, na muchi ghonihoghu ulowakeka bhenibhela mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu ambabhu ngachebhakabengakiki na Bhaizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Manase ngachebhatopwili bhenei bha muchi wa Beti Sheani na ijiji yaki, Taanaki na ijiji yaki, Doli na ijiji yaki, Ibeleamu na ijiji yaki, na Megido papamu na ijiji yaki. Nambu Bhakanaani bhakajendalili kutama mu inchi jeniheji. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli pabhakajonjukiki na kubha na makili, bhakabhajomalakili Bhakanaani bhahengaje lihengu lelinonwipe.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Efulaimu ngachebhatopwili Bhakanaani bhabhakabhili bhatama ku Gezeli hoku, kwa ndandi Bhakanaani bhakajendalili kutama mkati ja muchi wa Gezeli papamu na bhandu bhaka Efulaimu.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Bhelabhela likabila laka Zabuloni ngacheabhatopwili Bhakanaani bhabhakabhili bhatama ku Kitiloni, wala bhala bhabhakabhili bhatama ku Nahalali, nambu bhakajendalili kutama papamu nabhu, koni bhakabhajomalakyaje kuhenga lihengu lelinonwipe.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Bhandu bha likabila la Asheli ngachebhatopwili bhenei bha muchi wa Aka, Sidoni, Alabu, Akizibu, Heluba, Afeka, na Lehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Nambu bhandu bha likabila laka Asheli bhakatami pachilanda ja Bhakanaani, bhenei bha muchi ghonihoghu, kwa kubha ngachebhatopwile.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Nafutali ngachebhatopwili bhenei bha muchi wa Beti Shemeshi au bhenei bha Beti Anati, nambu bhakatami papamu nabhu. Hata bhela bhenei bha michi jeniheji, bhakajomalakiwi kubhahengela Bhaizilaeli lihengu lelinonwipe.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Bhaamoli bhakabhatopulili bhandu bha likabila laka Dani ku itombi. Ngachebhapekihi mbekenyu ja kuhelela kutama mu inchi ja kulibondi. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Bhaamoli bhakajendalili kutama mu michi jejikabhili mu chitombi cha Helesi, Aiyaloni, na Shaalibimu. Nambu bhandu bha makabila ghaka Efulaimu na Manase pabhabhili bhamaheli na kujonjukiki makili bhakabhaweziki Bhaamoli, na kubhajomalakela kuhenga lihengu ngati bhatumwa.<verse eid="JDG 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Ulindakanilu wa Bhaamoli ukatumbwili pa mpetu wa kulombukela papalowakeka Chipeleli, na kujendalela mbaka ku muchi wa Sela.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga ku Bokimu huko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga akakweliki kuhuma ku Giligali mbaka ku Bokimu, na kubhapwaghila Bhaizilaeli, “Nukunkwehiki mwehapa kuhuma ku Misili na kunjingiha mu inchi jenakalapiki kubhapekeha akahokolu bhinu. Nakapwaghaje, ‘Nganiheketi lulaghilu lwangu na mwehapa ng'o. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Na mwehapa ngamwitenda lulaghilu na bhandu bha inchi jenjenu, bhela mbombulaje pandu pabhu pa kubhokeha nyamabiku.’ Nambu mwehapa ngachemwajowanili sauti jango. Bho, maghambu kiki mtenda lijambu lenihele? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Kwa ndandi ja ghanihagha numpwaghila, nganabhatopoli kabheti bhandu bha muchi ghonihoghu pachilanda jinu, nambu bhandu bhanihaba anabhung'ahaje, na mwehapa anamkamulikaje mu indela ya kujojabhela ichapanga yabhu. ” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga paakajomwili kulongela mambu ghanihagha kwa Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, bhandu bhakaleliki kwa kujamalila. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Bhakapalohiki pandu panipala chelelu. Nabhombi bhakumbokili Bambo Chapanga nyambiku panihapa.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Yoshua paakabhatawiki Bhaizilaeli, kila jumu akapiti pandu paki pa kutama mu inchi jabhu. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Chikahi chokapi Yoshua paakabhili mwome, Bhaizilaeli bhakuntumakili Bambo Chapanga. Na hata baada ja nyiwa yaki, bhandu Bhaizilaeli bhakajendalili kuntumakila Chapanga machobha ghokapi ghabhakatamiki bhala akahilongizi bhabhahighalili bhabhayaweni matendu makolongwa ghaka Chapanga ghaabhahengili Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Yoshua mwana waka Nuni, mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga, akapotili akabya na umule wa hyaka mia moja na komi. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Bhakuntaghiki mu inchi je bughabhili jikubhaje jakea ku Timunati Helesi, mu inchi ja itombi ya Efulaimu, ku upambala wa kungode wa chitombi cha Gaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Panihapa bhandu bhokapi bha chibheleku chenihechi bhakapotili, chakajengalili chibheleku chengi ambachu ngachechummanyi Bambo Chapanga, wala matendu ghala ghaghakabhili aghatendiki kwa ndandi ja Bhaizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhakotoka kunjojabhela Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki mahoku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga na kubhajojabhela Baali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Bhakakotwiki kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa akatati bhabhu, joakabhili abhabhohiki mu inchi ja ku Misili. Bhakaijengalili na kuijojabhalela ichapanga patalipatali ya mataifa ghaghakabhili ghabhayongolota. Panihapa bhakuntendiki Bambo Chapanga kuhakalila namaa, <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />bhakundekiki Bambo Chapanga, na kunjojabhela kichapanga Baali na ichapanga ya chimbomba ya Maashitoleti. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhayomili Bhaizilaeli, kabheti akabhalelikiki bhanyaghula bhabhanyaghulaje hindu yabho na abhabhohiki kwa bhahakau bhau bhabhayongalwiti na ngachebhaweziki kabheti kulilenda bheni. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Pokapi Bhaizilaeli pabhapitaje kukomana, chiwoku chaka Bambo Chapanga chakabhili panani jabhu kubhatendela mahakau, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakapwaghili na kubhalapila. Nabhombi bhakabhili mu mang'ahiku makolongwa.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akabhajemiki bhatemula, ambabhu bhakabhakengalili kuhuma mu mabhoku gha bhandu bhanihabha bhabhakatoliki mateka hindu yabhu. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Nambu Bhaizilaeli ngachebhajowanili bhatemula bhabhu, maghambu bhakundekiti Bambo Chapanga na kuijojabhela ichapanga nayengi. Bhakang'anambwiki manyata na kujileka indela ambaju akatati bhabhu bhakajijendile, yani indela ja kutii amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga, nambu bhombi ngachebhahengiki bhenibhela. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Chikahi chokapi Bambo Chapanga paakabhapelakili ntemula, Bambo Chapanga akabhili papamu na ntemula hoju, najombi akabhakengalili kuhuma mu mabhoku ja maadui bhabhu kwa chikahi chokapi cheakatami na ntemula jola. Kwa kubha Bombo Chapanga akabhabhonili chiha kubhokana na chilelu chabhu cha kubhina ntima kwa ndandi ja bhala bhabhakabhili bhang'aha na kubhabhonela. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Nambu chikahi chokapi ntemula paakabhili apotili, bhandu bhakakelabhukili mu kutenda mahakau nakanopi kupeta akatati bhabhu, bhakaijengalya ichapanga nayengi nahuli kuitumakila na kuijojabhalela. Bhakakaniki kughaleka matendu ghabhu mahakau, na indela yabhu ya ing'omu. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akabhayomili namaa Bhaizilaeli na kupwagha, “Kwa kubha bhandu bha litaifa lendenu bhahekiti lulaghilu lwangu lonakabhalaghalakili akahokolu bhabhu, na kukotoka kojowanela sauti jangu, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />nepani nanatu nganabhatopoli bhandu bha litaifa lokapi lela ambabhu Yoshua akabhalekiki mangani ja kupotela. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Nahuli kwa indela jeniheji mbataje kubhalenga Bhaizilaeli, na kubhona ngati anabhajikamulaje indela jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kujenda mu indela jeniheji au ngabhela.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhalekiki bhandu bha mataifa ghanighala, ngacheakabhohiki kwa manyata, wala ngacheakumpekihi Yoshua uwezu wa kubhaweza bhandu bha mataifa ghanihagha.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Bhandu bha makabila ghangi ghaghakahighalili mu inchi ja Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Bhela bhambani nde bhandu bha makabila ambabhu Bambo Chapanga akabhalekiki, nahuli kubhalenga Bhaizilaeli bhokapi ambabhu ngachebhakalabhali kukomana ngondo jokapi jela mu inchi ja Bhakanaani. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Akatendiki bhenibhela nahuli kubhabhola ibheleku ya Bhaizilaeli ambabhu ngachebhakalabhali kukomana ngondo mangani ja panihapa. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Abhabha nde bhandu bha mataifa ambabhu Bambo Chapanga akabhalekike: Bhafilisti bhabhakabhili pahi ja bhakolongwa nhwanu, Bhakanaani bhokapi, Bhasidoni, na Bhahivi bhabhatama mu itombi ya Lebanoni, kutumbula chitombi cha Baali Helimoni mbaka ku Lebo Hamati. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Bambo Chapanga akabhalekiki bhandu bhanihabha nahuli awezaje kubhalenga Bhaizilaeli, na kubhona ngati anabhaweza kutii amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga, yeakabhalaghalakili akahokolu bhabhu, kwa kupetela Musa. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Bhela, Bhaizilaeli bhakatami papamu na Bhakanaani, Bhahiti, Bhaamoli, Bhapelizi, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Bhakabhatowili akakamwali bhabhu, nabhombi bhakabhabhohiki akakamwali bhabhu bhatoghulikaje na akakombu bha inchi yeniheyi, na kuijojabhela ichapanga yabhu.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otinieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakatendiki mahoku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, bhakunjewiki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wabhu, na kujojabhela imong'umong'u ya Mabaali na Maashitoleti. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akabhayomili Bhaizilaeli, najombi akabhalekiki bhalapulikaje na kubhabheka pahi ja lujiniku lwaka Kushani Lishataimu nkolongwa wa ku Mesopotamia, ambaju Bhaizilaeli bhakabhi pahi ja lujiniku lwaki koni bhakuntumakyaje kwa chikahi cha hyaka nane. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli pabhakundelili Bambo Chapanga, Bambo Chapanga akabhahaghulili mundu wa kubhakengalela, Otinieli mwana waka Kenazi, ndongu nchoku waka Kalebu. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Roho waka Bambo Chapanga akunhikili panani jaki, najombi akabhili mtemula wa bhandu bha Izilaeli. Bhela akabhokiki kujenda kungondo, najombi Bambo Chapanga akunjangatili kumuweza Kushani Lishataimu, nkolongwa wa ku Mesopotamia hoju. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Panihapa inchi jakabhili na lukwali kwa chikahi cha hyaka alobaini. Bhela Otinieli, mwana waka Kenazi, akapotile.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakakotwiki kabhete kuntii Bambo Chapanga kwa kuhenga mahoku, najombi Bambo Chapanga akumpekihi makili Egiloni, nkolongwa wa Moabu nahuli abhawezaje bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Egiloni akabhapaliki Bhaamoli na Bhaamaleki bhalombana naku, akapiti na kubhalapula Bhaizilaeli, nabhombi bhakautoliki kwa makili muchi wa Mitende hoghu, yani Yeliko.<verse eid="JDG 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakuntumakili Egiloni, nkolongwa wa Moabu kwa chikahi cha hyaka komi na nane.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakundelili Bambo Chapanga, najombi Bambo Chapanga akabhahaghulili mundu wa kubhakengalela, Ehudi, mwana waka Gela, mundu joakabhi atumi chiwoku cha kumangeja, wa likabila laka Benyamini. Bhaizilaeli bhakuntumiki Ehudi apelakaje nhupu yabhu kwaka Egiloni, nkolongwa wa Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehudi akalenganakili lipanga lelakabhili litema koni na koni, ulachu waki lakabhili sentimita hamsini. Akalikongiki lipanga leniheli mkati ja ingobhu jaki pa lipaja laki upambala wa chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Panihapa akumpelakili nkologwa Egiloni nhupu yela, Egiloni akabhili mundu joanenipi namaa. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehudi paakajomwili kubhoha nhupu, akabhapwaghi bhandu bhabhatotwili nhupu bhala, bhabhuja kunyumba. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Nambu jombi mweni akalonguhini nabhu mbaka ku imong'umong'u ya maganga yeyachongakiki pambipi na Giligali, panihapa jombi akakelawiki kujenda kwaka Egiloni na kumpwaghila, “Wenga nkolongwa, nepani mili na ubholu wa sili kwaku wehapa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">Nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Ntumbalaje chinunu!” Najombi akabhapwaghi bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhili bhajemiki pambipi najombi bhapita kunja na kundeka.<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Bhela Ehudi akunheghalili pandu pala paakabhili atami kanjika jaki mu chumba chaki cha kugholofa chechipetesha imbepu mu chikahi cha lumo. Ehudi akapwaghike, “Nepani mili na ubholu waku wehapa kuhuma kwaka Chapanga.” Nkolongwa akajumwiki kuhuma pa chiteu chaki. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ehudi akaholapwili lipanga laki kwa chibhoku chaki cha kumangeja kuhuma pa lipaja laki la kumalelelu, na kunhocha mulutumbu lwaka nkolongwa Egiloni kwa makili. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Lipanga lakujingili mkati mulutumbu papamu na mpini waki, mahuta ghakaliyekiki lipanga heli, ndandi Ehudi ngacheakaholapwili kabheti lipanga heli mulutumbu, nalombi lakabhili lipitalili kungongu. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Panihapa Ehudi akapitiki kunja pabalaza, akunjighalili milyangu ja chumba chenihechi na kujijighila kwa ufunguo. <verse eid="JDG 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ehudi paakabhokiki, bhatumika bhaka nkolongwa bhakahikike. Pabhakaweni milyangu jokapi ja chumba chenihechi jijighaliki kwa ufunguo, bhakaholalili kubha abhi kwiyetu ja chumba chenihechi. <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Bhakalendalili mbaka bhakatumbwili kubha na choghohi. Pabhakaweni ngacheahoghola milyangu, bhakatoliki ufunguo na kuhoghola. Lingalyaje, bhakumbweni nkolongwa wabhu aghonili pasakafu, koni akabya apotile.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Pabhakabhili bhakali kundendela, Ehudi akatiliki kujenda mbaka ku imong'umong'u ya maganga, na paakahikiki panihapa akakembalili ku Seila. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Paakahikiki konihoku akahoniki mbata mu inchi ja itombi ja Efulaimu, nabhombi Bhaizilaeli bhakahelili papamu najombi kuhuma ku chitombi hoku, koni jombi akabya abhalongulile. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Akabhapwaghile, “Nyengalyaje, maghambu Bambo Chapanga antendiki mwehapa mubhawezaje maadui bhinu Bhamoabu.” Bhakunjengalili mbaka ku chilomboku cha Yoludani, na kuchitola kwa makili kuhuma mu mabhoku gha Bhamoabu, wala ngachebhundekiki mundu jokapi jola kulomboka. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Lichobha leniheli, bhakakomakiki Bhamoabu akanalomi elufu komi, ambabhu bhokapi bhabhakangamile na bhabhakabhili na makili, wala njeta mundu hata jumu joakalamike. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Bhela lichobha leniheli Bhaizilaeli bhakabhaweziki Bhamoabu. Inchi jakabhili na lukwali kwa chikahi cha hyaka semanini.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shamgali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Paakapotili Ehudi, akahikiki Shamgali mwana waka Anati, jombi akabhakomiki Bhafilisti mia sita kwa imbehu jejahonguliki ja kudimila ng'ombi. Najombi bhelabhela akabhakengalili Bhaizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Debola na Balaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Bhela paakapoti Ehudi, Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki mahoku kabheti palongi ja mihu ghaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Bambo Chapanga akabhatendiki bhatolakika kwa makili na Yabini, nkolongwa wa ku Kanaani, joakatawili ku muchi wa Hazoli hoku. Nkolongwa waki wa manjolinjoli akalowakiki Sisela, joakabhili atama ku muchi wa Halosheti Hagoyimu. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakundelili Bambo Chapanga kundobha abhajangatyaje, maghambu nkolongwa Yabini akabhi na magali gha ngondo gha kuhutakika na falasi mia tisa gha choma. Najombi akabhili abhabhonili Bhaizilaeli kwa chikahi cha hyaka ishilini.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Chikahi hechi, kukabhili na mlota mbomba joakabhi alowakeka Debola, nhwanu waka Lapidoti, Debola nde joakabhili mtemula wa Bhaizilaeli mu chikahi chenichela. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Debola akabhili ajenda panihapa na kutama pahi ja nkongu wa mtende ghoukabhili pachilanda ja muchi wa Lama na muchi wa ku Beseli, mu inchi ja itombi ja Efulaimu. Bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakunjendili nahuli abhatemulyaje matakilu ghabhu. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Lichobha limu Debola akundohiki Balaki, mwana waka Abinoamu mwenei wa ku muchi wa Kedeshi mu inchi ja Nafutali. Paakahikiki akumpwaghile, “Bho, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, le ngacheakupwaghili, ‘Ujendaje ukabhabhonganaje bhandu kuchitombi cha Taboli hoku, na ukabhahaghulaje akanalomi elufu komi kuhuma mu likabila laka Nafutali na Zabuloni? <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Nepani ananunhuta Sisela, nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli ghaka Yabini, nahuli ahikaje na magali ghaki gha ngondo papamu na manjolinjoli ghaki kukomana na wehapa, pa nkoka Kishoni, nanau anaumuwezaje.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Balaki akumpwaghi Debola, “Ngati anaupiti papamu na nepani, ananyendaje. Nambu ngati ngaujendi papamu na nepani, nepani nganyende.”<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debola akamyangike, “Ena, ananyendaje papamu na wehapa, nambu mwanja ghoanaujendaje ngawipati utopelu wehapa, maghambu Bambo Chapanga anaantendaje nkolongwa Sisela alepalyaje kwaka mbomba.” Bhela Debola akapiti papamu na Balaki mbaka ku Kedeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Balaki akaghalohiki manjolinjoli papamu kuhuma mu makabila ghaka Nafutali na Zabuloni ku Kedeshi hoku, na bhandu elufu komi bhakunjengalile. Najombi Debola akapiti papamu naku.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Chikahi hechi, Hebeli, wa lukolu lwa Bhakeni, akabhili alitengiki na Bhakeni bhajaki, yani, bhabhelakeka bhaka Hobabu, ndamu waka Musa, najombi akachengiki lihema laki pambipi na nkongu ukolongwa wa mwaloni ghoukabhili ku Saanaimu ghola, pambipi na Kedeshi.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Bhandu bhakumpwaghi Sisela kubha Balaki, mwana waka Abinoamu akweliki kuchitombi cha Taboli, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Sisela akabhabhongini manjolinjoli ghaki ghokapi na magali ghaki gha choma gha kuhutakika na falasi mia tisa, akabhokiki ku Halosheti Hagoyimu, na kujenda ku nkoka wa Kishoni.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Debola akumpwaghi Balaki, “Haya ubhokaje! Lalenu nde lichobha ambalu Bambo Chapanga akutendiki umuwezaje Sisela. Bho, Bambo Chapanga le ngacheabhokiki kukulongulela palongi jako?” Panihapa Balaki akahulwiki kuhuma pachitombi cha Taboli, na manjolinjoli elufu komi bhakunjengalile. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Bambo Chapanga akunjeghili choghohi Sisela na bhokapi bhabhajendesha magali ghaki, papamu na manjolinjoli ghaki ghokapi kwa mapanga ghaghatema, palongi jaka Balaki. Bhela Sisela akahulwiki mu ligali laki na kutila kwa magholu. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Balaki akaghajengalili manjolinjoli ghanihagha, na magali ghanihagha, mbaka ku Halosheti Hagoyimu, na kubhakoma manjolinjoli ghokapi ghaka Sisela kwa mapanga ghaghatema. Njeta mundu hata jumu joakahighalili kubha mwome.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Nambu Sisela akatiliki kwa magholu mbaka mu lihema laka Yaeli, nkowanu waka Hebeli, wa lukolu lwa Bhakeni, maghambu pakabhili na lukwali pachilanda jaka Yabini nkolongwa wa Hazoli, na lukolu lwaka Hebeli, Mkeni. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yaeli akapitiki kujenda kunjopale Sisela, na kumpwaghila, “Nkolongwa wango, kalibu kwangu, wala ngawijoghopa.” Najombi Sisela akajingili mu lihema laka Yaeli, na Yaeli akamuyekiki kwa libulangeti. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisela akumpwaghi Yaeli, “Chondi, nobha machi machokopi ngunywi, maghambu mili na inywita.” Panihapa Yaeli akahowili nteku wa mahibha na kumpekeha akunywaje, na kumuyekalela kabheti. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Najombi Sisela akumpwaghile, “Ujemaje pundyangu wa lihema na mundu jokapi anahikiki na kukulalukila, akapwaghaje, ‘Bho, kubhi le na mundu jokapi jola pambane?’ Umuyangaje, ‘Njeta.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Nambu Yaeli, nhwanu waka Hebeli, akatoliki chipanda cha lihema na nyundu, akunjendili mbolimboli na akachikomalangili chipanda cha lihema chela pachibhongi cha pamihu jaki, chakunhotwili na kupitalila mbaka paluhombi, maghambu akabhili aghonili lughonu kwa kutonda. Bhela, Sisela akapotili palapala. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Balaki paakabhili anheghalela Sisela, Yaeli akapitiki kunja nahuli kunjopalela, na akumpwaghile, “Hikaje nanatu ananukulangihaje mundu jola joumpala.” Balaki akajingili mkati ja lihema laka Yaeli, na lingalyaje, akunhimanili Sisela pahi, akabya apotile, na chipanda cha lihema chela chakabhili pachibhongi chaki.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Bhela mu lichobha leniheli, Chapanga akabhajangatili Bhaizilaeli kumuweza Yabini, nkolongwa wa Kanaani. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Nabhombi Bhaizilaeli bhakajendalili kubha na makili nakanopi panani jaka Yabini, nkolongwa wa Kanaani, mbaka pabhakajomwili kunjonanga.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Lunyembu lwaka Debola na Balaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Lichobha leniheli, Debola na Balaki mwana waka Abinoamu, bhakajembiki lunyembu alolu:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Ihongozi bha Izilaeli bhakabhalongwi bhandu bhabhu kujenda kungondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">na chikahi bhandu pabhalibhoha kwa kupala bheni, mundumbalyaje Bambo Chapanga!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Njowanyaje lendenu, mwenga bhakolongwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Njowanyaje, mwenga bhatawala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Nepani ananunjembilaje Bambo Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Kwa lunyembu ananunchengulaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Bambo Chapanga, paukabhokiki ku chitombi cha Seili hoku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">paukahelili pachitombi Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">inchi jakabhaghiji, kunani kumahundi nakwombi kukajitili machi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">ena, mahundi ghakajitili iyula.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Itombi ikabhaghiji palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, hata chitombi chela cha Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Mu machobha ghaka Shamgali, mwana waka Anati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">mu machobha ghaka Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">indela ikolongwa ngacheyakabhili na bhandu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">nabhombi bhabhakabhi bhatenda mwanja bhakapetiki indela ya kunkeghi.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Bhalemi bhakakotwiki kulema mu Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">bhakajitiliki inchi ja Izilaeli mbaka panakahiki nepani Debola na kubha mtemula wabhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">panakajinwiki ngati mabhu mu Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Pabhakahawili kuijojabhela ichapanga yahenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">kukabhili na ngondu mu inchi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Bho, kukabhonakini lelu mundu joakabhili na ngau au nkoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">pachilanda ja bhandu alufu alobaini bha Izilaeli?<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Nabhapekeha utopelu ihongozi bha manjolinjoli bha Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">papamu na bhala bhabhakalibhohiki kwa kupala bheni pachilanda ja bhandu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">Munchengulaje Bambo Chapanga!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Mtangazaje malobhi ghani, mwehapa mwemtama panani ja maponda mahuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">mwehapa mwemtama panani ja uleli wa mbija yamaheli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">na mwehapa mwempeta mwindela kwa magholu.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Njowanyaje sauti ja bhajemba pandu pa kunywelela machi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Bhajemba kubhokana na mambu makolongwa ghaaghahengiki Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">bhalandila ntundu manjolinjoli gha Izilaeli mobhakabhawezile maadui bhabhu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11" />
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Panihapa bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga pabhakahelili pamilyangu mikolongwa ja muchi.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Jumuka, jumuka, Debola! Jumuka, jumuka, ujembaje lujembu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Jumuka, Balaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Ubhatolaje bhandu bhaku bhaubhatoliki kwa makili kungondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Wenga wa mwana waka Abinoamu!<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Panihapa mahighalilu gha bhalongwana na gha bhandu bhabhabhi na makili bhakahelili kwa ihongozi bhabhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">Bhandu bhaka Bambo Chapanga bhakahulwiki kwa ndandi jangu bhakomanaje na bhabhabhi na makili.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Kuhuma mu likabila laka Efulaimu bhakahikiki manjolinjoli, ambabhu utumbulilu wabhu nde Ameleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Benyamini akabya pachilanda ja bhandu bhabhakujengalili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Kuhuma mu likabila laka Makili bhakahelili ihongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">na kuhuma likabila laka Zabuloni, bhala bhabhakamula ndonga ja bhakolongwa bha manjolinjoli.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Ihongozi bhaka Isakali bhakabhili papamu na Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">ena, ihongozi bhaka Isakali akabhili papamu na Balaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">bhakakembili mbelu mbaka kulibondi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Nambu pachilanda ja likabila laka Leubeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">kukabhili na kulilalukila kukolongwa muntima.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Bho, maghambu kiki ukatami pachilanda ja mabheghi gha mambeleli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Nahuli kujowanela sauti ja filimbi jejiloha mapogha gha mambeleli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Mu ngolu ya likabila laka Leubeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">kukabhi na kulilalukila kukolongwa muntima ngati bhajendaji au ngabhijenda.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Gileadi bhakahighalili kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">bhandu bha likabila laka Dani, bho, maghambu kiki mkahighalili mu sitima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Bhandu bha likabila laka Asheli bhakatami chinunu mu maheku gha bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">bhakatami padowoku jaki.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Zabuloni nde bhandu bhabhakabhi tayali hata kupotela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">bhelabhela nabhombi bhandu bha likabila laka Nafutali pandu papajinwiki kumighonda.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Bhakolongwa bhakahikiki na kukomana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">bhakolongwa bha Kanaani bhakakomini ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">ku Taanaki hoku pambipi na chemichemi ja machi gha Megido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">nambu ngachebhakatoliki madini gha feza.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Ndondwa kuhuma kunani kumahundi ikakomini ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">ndondwa kuhuma mu indela jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">ikakomini na Sisela.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Nkoka wa Kishoni ukabhajoliki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">nkoka ghola wa mwandi, nkoka Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Nepani ananyendalyaje palongi kwa makili!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Panihapa nganyatilu ya mafalasi ghaka Sisela yakatendiki nking'indu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">mafalasi ghaki ghaghakabhi na makili, paghakabhi ghatila kuhuma kungondo.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Muchi wa Melozi upekiwaje masolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">Bhapekiwa masolu bhandu bhaki kwa ukali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">kwa kubha ngachebhakahikiki kunjangatila Bambo Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">kunjangatila Bambo Chapanga kukomana na bhabhabhili na makili habha.”<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Apengalikaje Yaeli nhwanu waka Hebeli, wa lukolu lwa Bhakeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">kupeta akambomba bhokapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">apengalikaje kupeta akambomba bhokapi bhabhatama mu mahema.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Sisela akundobhiki machi, Yaeli akumpekihi mahibha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">akundetili siagi mu bakuli la utopelu.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Chiwoku chimu akakamwili chipanda cha lihema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">na chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu nyundu jaka funde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">Akundapwili Sisela kwa nyundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">akunhotwili mmutu waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">akuntunywili tunywili na kunhotola pachibhongi ja pamihu jaki.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Sisela akajinimi pamagholu ghaka Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">akahawiki na kughonela panihapa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Paakajinimi pamagholu pala, akahawiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">paakajinimi pala, panihapa nde paakahawiki, koni akabya apotile.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Kupetela palidilisha mabhu waka Sisela akalingalili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">palidilisha akaleliki, akapwaghaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">“Bho, maghambu kiki ligali laki likabhakili kuhika?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">“Bho, maghambu kiki miking'indu ja magali ghaki ghakabhakili kujowaneka?”<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Akambomba bhabhabhili na mbulau bhabhakabhi bhuntumakila bhakamuyangiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">ena, akalipekihi mweni liyangu kabheti na kabheti.<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />“Panga na choghohi bhalonda na kughabhana mateka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">kamwali jumu au bhabheli kwa kila linjolinjoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ingobhu jejilenganakiki kwa mangoma gha limbeleli ja langi kwa kwandi jaka Sisela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ingobhu jejilenganakiki wichu kwa mangoma gha limbeleli, na majuda ghabheli gha kunyamba kwa ndandi ja hingu jangu.”<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Maadui bhaku bhokapi na bhayonangikaje bhenibhela, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Nambu bhokapi bhabhakupala na bhakubha ngati lyobha molipiti kwa makili!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:31" />
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Bhela inchi jakabhiili na lukwali kwa chikahi cha hyaka alobaini.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Gidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki mahoku kabhete palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, najombi Bambo Chapanga akabhalekiki bhalepalyaje palongi ja Bhamidiani kwa chikahi cha hyaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Bhamidiani bhakabhabhoni namaa Bhaizilaeli, mbaka Bhaizilaeli bhakalihembili mabhomba na mambaku muitombi kubha pandu pabhu pa kulihiya. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Kila chaka Bhaizilaeli pabhapandika imbeju mu mighonda, manjolinjoli bha Bhamidiani, na Bhaameleki na makabila ghangi gha kolipita lyobha hoku bhakahikiki kubhalapula. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Manjolinjoli bha inchi yeniheyi bhakabhekiki likambi mu inchi jeniheji, bhakabhalapwili na kuyonanga ilebhi yokapi mu inchi mbaka mumalindakilu gha Gaza, ngachebhakabhalekili Bhaizilaeli chokapi, ikubhi mambeleli, ng'ombi wala maponda. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Bhakahikiki na hinyama yabhu na mahema ghabhu, uhwananganu wa mabhongelu gha nzige. Ikabhili ngacheiwezikana kubhabhalanga bhandu na ngamia yabhu, bhakajingili mu inchi heji nahuli kujiyonanga. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Bhaizilaeli bhakatendakiki kubha akakahochu namaa na Bhamidiani, mbaka bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakundeli Bambo Chapanga kulobha ujangatilu.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Bhaizilaeli pabhukundelili Bambo Chapanga kwa ndandi ja mang'ahiku ghabhapekewa na Bhamidiani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Bambo Chapanga akuntumiki mlota, ambaju akabhapwaghile: Lendenu nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, leapwagha, “Nepani nakumbohiki ku Misili, kuhuma mu inchi jemkabhi ntama ngati bhatumwa. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Nanatu nakunkengalili kuhuma kwa Bhamisili bhokapi bhabhakabhi bhumbonela. Nepani nakabhatopwili bhabhokaje palongi jinu, nanatu nakumpekihi mwehapa inchi jabhu. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Nukumpwaghile: Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga winu, ngamwaijojabhela ichapanga ya Bhaamoli, ambamu mwehapa mtama mu inchi jabhu sajenu. Nambu mwehapa ngachemwajowanili sauti jango.”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga akahikiki na kutama pahi ja nkongu wa mwaloni ku Ofula hoku, nkongu wa mwaloni hoghu ukabhili waka Yoashi, wa lukolu lwaka Abiezeli, na Gidioni mwana waki akabhili apeta nganu kwa kulihiya mkati ja pandu pakuminyila zabibu, nahuli Bhamidiani ngabhambona. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga akumpitalili Gidioni, akumpwaghili, “Bambo Chapanga abhi papamu na wehapa, wenga wanga kujoghopa na weubhi na makili!”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gidioni akapwaghike, “Bambo Chapanga wango, ngati Bambo Chapanga abhili papamu na tepani, bho, mbona mambu aghagha ghokapi ghatupitalile? Henu ghabhi kwako matendu ghaki makolongwa ghala ambaghu akahokolu bhitu bhakatulandili kupetela jombi pabhakapwaghiki, ‘Bho, Bambo Chapanga ngacheakatukwehike kubhoka ku Misili?’ Nambu henu Bambo Chapanga atulekiki tubhoniwaje na Bhamidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Bambo Chapanga akundingalili na kupwagha, “Jendaje kwa uwezu waku hoghu, ukabhakengalyaje bhandu bha Izilaeli bhabhoka kuhuma mu kubhonewa na Bhamidiani. Bho, nga nepani lelu nenukutuma wehapa?”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Gidioni akayangike, “Bambo Chapanga wango, bho, ananabhakengalya Bhaizilaeli kwa ntundu bhole? Lingalyaje, lukolu lwangu nde akakahochu nakanopi na ngachemi na makili mu likabila laka Manase, na nepani nde nunchoku wa bhokapi mu nyumba jaka tati wangu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Bambo Chapanga akamyangike, “Chakaka anangubha papamu na wehapa, na wehapa anaubhalapula Bhamidiani ngati abhi mundu jumu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gidioni akumpwaghile, “Ngati mbatiki chihomu pamihu jaku, henu unangiya nginyulila, nahuli manyaje kubha chakaka wehapa nde weulongela na nepani. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Chondi nukulobha ngawibhoka pambane mbaka panikelabhukaje na kukuletela nhupu jangu, na kujibheka palongi jaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">Najombi Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Ananendalyaje mbaka pawikelabhukaje.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gidioni akajingili mkati ja nyumba jaki na kuandaa mwana mbuhi papamu na kujocha mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila kuhuma mu lidebi la uhembi, akajeghi inyama mkati ja chikapu na imitu mkati ja chipika, akundetili mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga hoju kunja pahi ja nkongu wa mwaloni na kumpekeha. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Tola nyama na mabumunda jangakujeghaleka amila, ubhekaje panani ja litalaghu lenu na ujeghalaje imitu heji panani jaki.” Gidioni akatendiki bhelabhela. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga akahatambwili ndonga jejikabhili mu chiwoku chaki, akajigusiki inyama jela na mabumunda jangakujeghaleka amila ghala, moto ukapitiki mu litalaghu ukayoningi inyama jela na mabumunda ghala. Mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga akahobhiki palongi jaki.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Gidioni paakamanyiki kubha nde mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo Chapanga, Gidioni akalapwi njobhela kwa ukangachu, akapwagha, “Ananichibhonaje nepani, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu! Kwa kubha numbweni Bambo Chapanga pamihu kwa pamihu!”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghili, “Lukwali lukubhaje papamu na wehapa! Ngawijoghopa. Ngaupoteli.” <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Gidioni akunchengili Bambo Chapanga pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku konihoku na kupaloha, “Yehova Shalomu,” yani Bambo Chapanga nde Lukwali. Pandu panihapa pa kubhokeha nyambiku pakali pabhili mbaka lalenu ku Ofula hoku ku muchi wa lukolu lwa Bhaabiezeli.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Ikilu jelajela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghili Gidioni, “Utolaje ng'ombi jikambaku jaka tati waku, bhelabhela utolaje ng'ombi ja kabheli jejibhi na hyaka saba, na ubhombulaje pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku paka Baali paakabhi naku tati waku, na ukahekataje imong'umong'u ya Ashela yeibhili pambipi nayu. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Unchengila Bambo Chapanga waku, chindu chinyahi cha kumokeha nyambiku chechibhi chinyahi panani ja chitombi chenjenu. Utumilaje hanju ja mapali ja Ashela jewitunyulini, ubhohaje nyambiku likambaku la kabheli heli kubha nyambiku ja kujochakeka.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Panihapa Gidioni akabhatoliki bhatumika bhaki komi na kutenda ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakili. Nambu kwa kubha akabhajowipi bhandu bha munyumba jaka tati waki na bhandu bha muchi ghonihoghu, akahengiki mambu ghanihagha chikahi cha ikilu, badala ja muhi.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Bhandu bha muchi pabhakajumwiki lukela, lingalyaje, pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku paka chimong'umong'u chaka Baali chakabombuliwi na mapali gha chimong'umong'u chaka Ashela chechikabhili pambipi jaki chakahekitwe, na ng'ombi ja kabheli jakabhili jibhohakiki nyambiku panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku papachengakiki hapa. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Bhakalaluhine, “Bho, nde nane joatendiki mambu ghangane?” Pabhakalalukili na kulonda wichu, bhakamanyiki, “Gidioni, mwana waka Yoashi, nde joatendiki anana.” <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Bhandu bha muchi bhakumpwaghi Yoashi, “Undetaje mwana waku pambane. Ipalika apotilaje, kwa ndandi abhombwili pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku paka kichapanga Baali na kuheketa mapali ghaka kichapanga Ashela jeikabhili pambipi naju.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Nambu Yoashi akabhapwaghili bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhili bhapengana na jombi, “Bho, mwehapa munjemalela Baali? Bho, mlenga kunkengalela? Jokapi jonaankengalyaje anakomakikaje kuhikila chilabhu lukela. Ngati Baali nde kichapanga chakaka, bhela, aweza kulikengalela mweni, maghambu pandu paki pa kubhokeha nyambiku pabombuliwe.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Lichobha heli bhandu bhakundohiki Gidioni, “Yelubaali” Ndandi jaki, “Baali na alikengalyaje palongi jaki,” maghambu Gidioni akabombwili pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku paka kichapanga Baali.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Chikahi hechi Bhamidiani na Bhaameleki, na makabila ghangi gha kolipita lyobha bhakajetanganili kujenda kungondo papamu, bhakalombwiki kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani na kuchenga makambi ghabhu mu libondi la Yezileeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Panihapa Roho waka Bambo Chapanga akunhiki Gidioni, akahoniki mbata, akabhalohaje bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Abiezeli nahuli bhunjengalyaje. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Akabhatumiki bhatenga mu inchi jokapi jaka Manase kubhaloha bhahikaje kunjengalela. Bhatenga bhangi akabhatumiki kubhaloha bhandu bha makabila ghaka Asheli, Zabuloni na Nafutali, nabhombi bhakahikiki kulombana naku.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Bhela Gidioni akumpwaghi Chapanga, “Ngati anawakengalili Bhaizilaeli kwa kundumi nepani, ngati mowakapwaghile, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />lingalyaje, anameka chingokolu cha limbeleli mu chibhanja cha kupetela inganu, na ngati anapabhili na lyangami panani ja chingokolu pena, na inchi jokapi anajibhi jijomu, bhela panihapa nde anamanyaje kubha wehapa anaunyangatya nepani kubhakengalela Bhaizilaeli, ngati mowapwaghile.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Bhenibhela nde mokukapitalile. Gidioni akabhokiki lukela pachibhombu, akaminyiki chingokolu chela, lyangami lakapitiki, na libakuli lakatweli machi. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Panihapa Gidioni akumpwaghi Bambo Chapanga, “Chondi ngawaniyomela. Nukulobha mbwaghi kabhete mala punkamu pela. Nukulobha unekaje ndumilaje chingokolu chenjenu kutenda lihengu lengi. Nukulobha panani ja chingokolu chenjenu pakubhaje pajomu, nambu paluhombi pokapi pakubhaje na lyangami.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Ikilu jela Chapanga akatendiki bhenibhela. Chingokolu chela chakabhili chijomu, na paluhombi pokapi pakabhi na lyangami.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gidioni abhaweza Bhamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Panihapa Yelubaali, yani Gidioni, na manjolinjoli bhaki bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu najombi bhakabhokiki lukela pachibhombu, na kubheka likambi labhu pambipi na chemichemi ja Halodi. Likambi la Bhamidiani lakabhi upambala wabhu wa kungondi mu libondi, pambipi na chitombi cha Mole.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Gidioni, “Bhandu habha bhabhabhi papamu na wehapa nde bhamaheli namaa kwangu nepani kuweza kubhashinda Bhamidiani, nahuli Bhaizilaeli ngabhihika kulilumbalila panani jangu, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Bhalikengalili kwa makili ghabhu bheni. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Henu ubhatangazyaje bhandu bhokapi kubha: Mundu jokapi joabhi na choghohi au joabhaghaja abhokaje pambane pachitombi cha Gileadi na bhujaje kunyumba jaki,’ ” Panihapa bhakabhokiki bhandu elufu ishilini na ibheli kubhuja kumanyumba, na kuhighalila bhandu elufu komi.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghili Gidioni, “Bhandu habha bhakona bhamaheli namaa. Ubhapelakaje pahi mu machi nanatu ananabhalengaje konihoku kwa ndandi jaku. Ngati ananukupwaghili, ‘Ajoju anajenda papamu na wehapa,’ jombi anajendaje. Nambu ngati anambwaghiki, ‘Ajoju ngayijenda papamu na wehapa,’ jonihoju ngayijenda.” <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Panihapa Gidioni akabhapeliki bhandu pandu papabhili na machi, najombi Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghili Gidioni, “Bhandu bhabhakunywa machi kwa lulimi, ngati nakawa moinywelela, ubhatengaje na bhala bhokapi bhabhachikama nahuli kunywa machi.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Ubhalangiku wa bhala bhabhakakunywiki machi kwa kulamba ngati nakawa bhakabhi mia tatu, Nambu bhangi bhokapi bhabhakahighalili bhakachikimi na kunywa machi. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Gidioni, “Kwa manjolinjoli mia tatu habha bhabhakunywiki machi ananunkengalyaje mwehapa, nanatu ananukutenda weapa mubhashinda Bhamidiani. Ubhapwaghilaje bhandu bhangi bhokapi habha kila jumu abhujaje kunyumba jaki.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Bhela Gidioni akabhalekiki Bhaizilaeli bhangi bhala kila jumu ajendaje mu lihema laki. Akahighalili na bhandu mia tatu bhala, ambabhu bhakatoliki hilebhi na mbata ya bhandu bhangi bhala bhabhabhujiki kumanyumba ghabhu. Likambi la Bhamidiani likabhili kulibhondi upambala wabhu wa pahi waka Gidioni na bhandu bhake.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Ikilu jelajela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Gidioni, “Ujendaje ukabhalapulaje mu makambi ghabhu, maghambu ananukutendaje ubhashindaje. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Nambu ngati anaujoghopa kuhelela, helalaje papamu na Pula mtumika waku kulikambi. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Konihoku anaujowanaje ghabhapwagha, na wehapa anaupata makili gha kuweza kujenda kubhalapula.” Panihapa Gidioni akahelili papamu na mtumika waki Pula mbaka mu pandu pa bhalenda bhabhu bha likambi la Bhamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Manjolinjoli bha Bhamidiani, na Bhaameleki na papamu na manjolinjoli bhokapi bha kolipita lyobha bhakatami kulibhondi, nabhombi bhakabhili ngati nzige kwa umaheli wabhu. Ngamia yabhu ngachejakabhalangiki, umaheli wabhu ukabhili ngati luhanga lwa mumaheku ja bahali.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gidioni paakahikiki, lingalyaje, pakabhi na mundu jumu joakabhi andandila njaki ndoto, akapwaghaje, “Lingalyaje, nakalotiki ndoto, libumunda la shayili lakahawiki mu likambi la Bhamidiani, lakahikiki mbaka mu lihema limu, lakalilapwili mbaka lakahawiki, nalombi lakalipendwili, mbaka lihema lakahawiki pahi.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Nkochi waki akamuyangiki, “Malobhi ghani nga chindu chengi, nambu ilangi kubha nde lipanga laka Gidioni mwana waka Yoashi, Muizilaeli. Chapanga atutendiki tepani Bhamidiani na manjolinjoli ghokapi kulepalela palongi jaki.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gidioni paakajowini ndoto jeniheji na ndandi jaki, akachikimi na kunjojabhela Chapanga. Akakelawiki ku likambi la Izilaeli na kupwagha, “Njemanyaje! Bambo Chapanga abhatendiki manjolinjoli bha Bhamidiani kulepalela palongi jinu.” <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Panihapa akabhaghabhiki bhandu mia tatu bhala mu mapogha ghatatu, akabhapekihi mbata mu mabhoku ghabhu bhokapi na ihulu yangakubha na machi, na myenge jejibhelela mkati ja ihulu heyi. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Akabhapwaghile, “Mningalyaje, ntendaje bhelabhela ngati monitenda nepani, panihikaje pambipi na likambi. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Chikahi nepani na bhala bhabhabhili papamu na nepani bhokapi, patwihona mbata hitu, mwehapa nanamu mhonaje mbata upambala wokapi wa likambi na kulapula njobhela, mpwaghaje, ‘Kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kwa ndandi jaka Gidioni!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Gidioni na bhandu mia jimu bhala bhabhakabhili papamu naku bhakahikiki kuujomukelu wa likambi ikilu pamahiku chikahi cha utumbulilu wa zamu ja pachilanda, chikai pena manjolinjoli pabhakabhili bhang'anambulana zamu yamu mu likambi la maadui. Bhakahoniki mbata yabhu na kukajula ihulu yela yeyakabhili mu mabhoku ghabhu. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Na mapogha ghokapi ghatatu ghala ghakahoniki mbata na kukajula ihulu. Bhakakamwili myengi kwa mabhoku ghabhu gha kumangeja na mumabhoku ghabhu gha kumalelelu bhakakamwi mbata nahuli kuihona, koni bhakapwagha kwa sauti ngolongwa, “Lipanga kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kwa ndandi jaka Gidioni!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Bhakajemiki kila mundu pandu paki kuliyongolota likambi upambala wokapi, Bhamidiani bhokapi bhakatiliki, koni bhakajamalyaje kwa sauti ngolongwa. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Pabhakajembiki mbata mia tatu yela, Bambo Chapanga akabhatendiki Bhamidiani bhatumbula kujomulana bheni kwa bheni kwa mapanga mu likambi. Bhabhakahighalili bhakatiliki ku Beti Shita, na kujendalela mbaka ku Selela, mbaka ku malindakanilu gha Abeli Mehola pambipi na Tabati.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Akanalomi bha Izilaeli bhakabhili bhalibhongini kuhuma ku Nafutali, na kuhuma ku Asheli, na kuhuma kwaka Manase jokapi, bhakabhajengalili Bhamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gidioni akabhatumiki bhatenga mu inchi jokapi ja itombi yaka Efulaimu, bhakapwaghaje, “Muhelalaje kukomana na Bhamidiani na kuhibhalakila ilomboku ya nkoka Yoludani mbaka ku Beti Bala.” Henu, akanalomi bhokapi bhaka Efulaimu bhakahikiki na kuuyongolota nkoka wa Yoludani mbaka ku Beti Bala. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Kabheti bhakabhakamwili ihongozi bhabheli bha Bhamidiani, yani Olebu na Zeebu. Bhakunkomiki Olebu pa litalaghu la Olebu pala, na Zeebu bhakunkomiki palibhomba la kuminyila divai la Zeebu pala. Panihapa bhakabhajengalili Bhamidiani na kuleta mmutu waka Olebu na Zeebu kwaka Gidioni, kwihi ja nkoka Yoludani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Kuweza kwaka Gidioni na kulepa kisasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Bhela bhandu bha likabila la Efulahimu bhakundalukili Gidioni, “Bho, maghambu kiki ututendili anana? Bho, maghambu kiki ngachewakatulohiki pawakapiti kukomana ngondo na Bhamidiani?” Bhakabhapwaghiki kwa ukale.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Nambu Gidioni akabhayangike, “Mambu ghandendiki nepani nga chindu anaghalenganishwi na ghala ghantendiki mwehapa. Chela chichoku chentendiki mwehapa mabhandu bha likabila la Efulahimu nde chikolongwa na chinyahi kupeta chela chebhatendiki bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Abiezeli. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Chapanga antendiki mubhawezaje ihongozi bha Bhamidiani, yani Olebu na Zeebu. Bho, nepani nhweziki kutenda kiki kulenganesha na chentendiki mwehapa?” Gidioni paakapwaghiki leniheli, inyela yabhu panani jaki yakatumbili.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Gidioni na bhajaki bhakahikiki punkoka Yoludani, akalombwiki jombi papamu na bhandu mia tatu bhabhakabhi papamu naku bhala, hata ngati bhakatondiki namaa, bhakajendalili kubhajengalela maadui bhabhu. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Bhela pabhakahikiki ku muchi wa Sukoti, Gidioni akabhapwaghi bhandu bha panihapa, “Chondi mwapekyaje bhajangu abhabha mabumunda maghambu bhatondiki namaa, na nepani nyendale kubhajengalela Zeba na Salimuna, bhakolongwa bha ku Midiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Nambu hilongozi bhaku Sukoti bhakundalukili, “Kwa ndandi kiki tubhapekiha chilebhi na mwehapa mkona ngachemumbweziki Zebha na Salimuna?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gidioni akapwaghike, “Nde wichu, Bambo Chapanga payinyangatyaje nunkamulaje Zeba na Salimuna mu mabhoku ghangu, anangachulanaje hyegha hinu kwa miha ya mulipololu, na mingwandu!” <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Kuhuma panihapa akapiti mbaka ku muchi wa Penieli kubhalobha chilebhi, nambu bhandu bha ku muchi wa Penieli bhakamuyangiki ngati bhandu bha ku muchi wa Sukoti mobhakayangile. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Gidioni akabhapwaghili bhandu bha ku muchi wa Penieli, “Panikelabhukaje koni nakabya nhweziki, anamombulaje mnala ghoni!”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Zeba na Salimuna bhakabhili ku muchi wa Kalikoli papamu na linjolonjoli labhu la bhandu elufu komi na nhwanu ambabhu bhakahighalili kuhuma mu linjolinjoli la ku inchi ya kolipita lyobha, maghambu bhajabhu elufu komi na bhabheli bhakakomakiki. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gidioni akajengalili indela ja kolijibhi lyobha jejibhili ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa muchi wa Noba na Yogibeha, akabhalapwili linjolinjoli heli ambalu ngachelakabhili tayali. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Zeba na Salimuna, bhakolongwa bhabheli bha ku Midiani habha, bhakatilike, nambu Gidioni akabhajengalili na kubhakamula, na kubhatenda manjolinjoli ghabhu ghokapi kubha na choghoi.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Bhela Gidioni mwana waka Yoashi akakelawiki kuhuma kungondo kwa kupetela pandu papajinwiki pa Helesi. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Akunkamwi nkombu jumu wa ku muchi wa Sukoti na kundalukila mahina gha ihongozi, najombi nkombu jola akundembili Gidioni mahina sabini na saba gha ihongozi na bhazee bhabhamanyikana nakanopi mu muchi wa Sukoti. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Gidioni akakelawiki kwa bhandu bhaki bha ku muchi wa Sukoti, na kubhapwaghila, “Bho, mkomboka lelu ntundu momwandondulili chikahi pamkapwaghiki: Bho, maghambu kiki tubhapekya chilebhi bhandu bhaku bhabhatondiki namaa, koni mwakali ngachemunhweziki Zeba na Salimuna? Henu ndingalyaje, Zeba na Salimuna nde bhambane!” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Bhela Gidioni akabhatoliki ihongozi bha muchi wa Sukoti na kubhakachulana hyegha yabhu kwa miha na mingwandu ja mulipololu ngati libholu nahuli kubhabhola. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Bhelabhela kapiti ku muchi wa Penieli, na kuubombola mnala wa muchi wa Penieli na kubhakoma bhandu bha muchi ghonihoghu.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Bhela akabhalalukili Zeba na Salimuna, “Bho, bhakabhonakini ngati bhandu bha ntundu bhole bhaubhakomiki ku Taboli hoko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Bhakamuyangike, “Bhakalengini na wehapa, maghambu bhakabhonakini ngati bhana bhaka nkolongwa.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gidioni akabhayangiki, “Bhanihabha bhakabhili bhalongu bhango, bha lutumbu lumo. Napa kwaka Bambo Chapanga joabhi mwomi, ngati mkabhi mubhalekiki kubha bhomi, nepani nganakunkomiki mwehapa.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Akung'anambukili Yeteli, mwana waki mbelakeka wa kutumbula, na kumpwaghila, “Jemaje, ubhakomaje abhabha!” Nambu Yeteli akajowipi kutola lipanga laki, kwa ndandi akabhi akona nkombu nchoku.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Bhela Zeba na Salimuna bhakapwaghike, “Utukomaje wehapa wamwete, ndandi aleli nde lihengu laka mundu joakolike.” Henu Gidioni akajemiki, akabhakomiki Zeba na Salimuna, najombi akaghabhohiki mapambu mu hingu ya ngamia yabhu.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakumpwaghi Gidioni, “Wehapa na ukubhaje chiongozi witu, na anaupetiki wehapa mbelakeka waku, na nchokolu waku atutawalaje, maghambu wehapa utukengalili kuhuma mu makili gha Bhamidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Gidioni akabhayangike, “Nepani ngangubhi mtawala winu wala bhabhelekeka bhangu ngabhantawali mwanganya. Bambo Chapanga nde jonakubha mtawala winu.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Najombi akapwaghike, “Mili na lilobhu limu, kubha kila jumu winu ambekyaje ndolowa kuhuma mu lifungu laki leakatoliki kwa makili kungondo.” Bhamidiani bhakabhi ngati Bhaishimaeli na bhandu bhangi bhabhakabhi bhatama ku lipololu, bhakabhi bhawata ndolowa ya zahabu.<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Bhandu bhakayangike, “Anatukupekyaje kwa kupala tabhete.” Bhakatandiki ingobhu pahi, na kila jumu akabhekiki monihomu ndolowa yeakatoliki kwa makili kungondo. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Kutopa kwa ndolowa ya zahabu yeakapekiwi Gidioni yakabhi kilu ishilini, panga kubhalanga mapambu ghangi gha mbija yamaheli, na ingobhu ya zambalau yeyakabhili ihwatakika na bhakolongwa bha ku Midiani, na mikufu jejakabhili mu hingu ya ngamia yabhu. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gidioni akalenganakili chimong'umong'u kwa kutumila zahabu jela, ambachu akachibhekiki mu muchi waki wa Ofula. Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakapiti kuchijojabhela konihoku, nachombi chakabhili chimbenda kwaka Gidioni na kwa bhandu bha munyumba jaki.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Bhela Bhamidiani bhakalepalili palongi ja Bhaizilaeli, nabhombi ngachebhang'ahiki kabheti Bhaizilaeli. Na inchi ja Izilaeli jakabhi na lukwali kwa chikahi cha hyaka alobaini mu machobha ghaka Gidioni.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Gidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Gidioni, yani Yelubaali, mwana wa Yoashi akakelawiki kunyumba jaki na kutama konihoku. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gidioni akabhi na bhana bha chikambaku sabini, kwa ndandi akatowili akambomba bhamaheli. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Na mtumika waki wa chimbomba, joakabhi atama ku Shekemu hoku, akumbelakili mwana wa chikambaku na akundohiki lihina laki Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gidioni mwana waka Yoashi akapotili akabya mzee, na akataghakiki mu litengeli laka Yoashi tati waki ku Ofula, muchi wa lukolu lwaka Abiazeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Paakapoti pena Gidioni, Bhaizilaeli bhakaikelabhukili ichapanga ya Baali na kuijojabhela. Bhakuntendiki Baali Beliti kubha kichapanga wabhu. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Bhaizilaeli bhakunjewiki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wabhu, joabhakengalili kuhuma mu mabhoku gha maadui bhabhu bhokapi kuhuma kila upambala. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Kabheti, bhakalepalili kubhatendela ghamboni bhandu bha munyumba jaka Yelubaali yani Gidioni, hata ngati Gidioni akahengiki mambu ghamboni kwa bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Lichobha limu, Abimeleki, mwana waka Yelubaali, yani Gidioni akapiti kwa bhalongu bhaka mabhu waki ku Shekemu hoku na kubhapwaghila, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Mbwaghilaje palongi ja bhandu bhokapi abhabha bha Shekemu, ‘Bho, lijambu bholi lelibhili lamboni kwinu? Bhana bhokapi sabini bha chikambaku bhaka Yelubaali bhantawalaje au mundu jumo?’ Nkombukaje kubha nepani na mwehapa nde mwahi ghumu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Bhalongu bhaka mabhu waki bhakatangizi malobhi ghanihagha ku Shekemu pandu paki, na bhandu bhokapi bha ku Shekemu bhakajetakili kunjengalela ndandi jombi akabhi ndongu wabhu. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Bhakumpekihi ipandi sabini ya madini gha feza yeyakabhi mu nyumba jaka Baali Beliti, najombi Abimeleki akaitumili kubhahemela bhandu bhanamilomu na bhandu bha liyaha, nahuli bhunjengalyaje. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Abimeleki na bhandu bhaki bhakapiti mbaka kunyumba jaka tati waki ku Ofula hoku, akabhakomiki bhalongu bhaki, bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yelubaali, bhandu sabini, akabhakomiki panani ja liganga limu, nambu Yotamu, mwana nchoku waka Yelubaali, akahighalili maghambu akatehi kulihiya. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Bhela bhandu bhokapi bha ku Shekemu na Beti Milo bhakalibhongini papamu pahi ja nkongu ukolongwa wa mwoloni pa nguzu jejibhi ku Shekemu na kunhimika Abimeleki kubha nkolongwa wabhu.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Yotamu paakajowini malobhi ghanihagha, akapiti kujema panani ja chitombi cha Gelizimu, na kujamalila kwa sauti ngolongwa, “Nyowanyaje nenga mabhandu bha Shekemu, nahuli Chapanga najombi apata kunjoghunela mwehapa. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Lichobha limu mikongu jakahimangini kunhaghula nkolongwa. Bhela mikongu jakumpwaghili nkongu wa mzeituni, ‘Wehapa ubya nkolongwa witu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Nambu nkongu wa mzeituni ukayangike, ‘Bho, ngotukaje kupiha mahuta ghangu ambaghu kwa ghanihagha ichapanga na bhandu bhatopalewa, nyendaje kuling'aha kujitawala mikongu?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Panihapa mikongu jakaupwaghili nkongu wa nkoju, ‘Hikaje ubya nkolongwa witu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Nambu nkongu wa nkoju ukayangike, ‘Bho, ngotukaje kupiha mapambiku ghangu manyahi na manohu, nyendaje kuling'aha kujitawala mikongu?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Panihapa mikongu jakaupwaghili nkongu wa mzabibu, ‘Hikaje na ukubhaje nkolongwa witu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Nambu nkongu wa mzabibu ukayangike, ‘Bho, ngotukaje kupiha divai jangu jejihekeha ichapanga na bhandu, nyendaje kuling'aha kujitawala mikongu?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Ujomukelu mikongu jokapi jakaupwaghili nkongu wa miha, ‘Hikaje na ukubhaje nkolongwa witu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Nkongu wa miha ukayangike, ‘Ngati chakaka mpala kunhaghula nepani kubha nkolongwa winu, muhikaje mtamaje pahi ja nhwili wangu. Nambu ngati ngachempala kuhenga bhenibhela, moto na upitaje mu miha yangu na kuyonangaje hata mikongu ja mielezi ja Lebanoni.’<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />“Panihapa Yotamu akajendalili kupwagha bho, muhambuki kubha ntendiki kwa maholalelu manyahi na kwa ulongwana kunhaghula Abimeleki kubha nkolongwa wino? Bho muhambukila muntendili wichu Yelubaali na bhandu bha munyumba jake? Ngati mokupalikila kwa mambu ghaki ghamboni ghaantendile? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Kwa kubha tati wangu akunkomani mwehapa, kwa kughabheka matamu ghaki mu hatali, na kunkengalela mwehapa kuhuma mu mabhoku gha Bhamidiani, <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />nambu lalenu mubhalapula bhandu bha munyumba jaka tati wangu na kubhakoma bhana bhaki bha chikambaku sabini panani ja liganga limu, na mwehapa muntendiki Abimeleki, mwana waka mbomba mtumwa kubha nkolongwa panani ja Shekemu, kwa kubha jombi nde ndongu winu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Henu ngati anamtendiki ghanihagha kwa mtima wamboni na kwa kuntopela Yelubaali na bhandu bha munyumba jaki, henu muhekalyaje papamu na Abimeleki, najombi ahekalyaje papamu na mwenga. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Nambu ngati ngabhela, moto upitaje kwaka Abimeleki na kunjonanga, mwenga mabhandu bhaka Shekemu na Beti Milo, nawombi moto uhuma kwinu, mabhandu bhaka Shekemu na Beti Milo unjonangaje Abimeleki.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Panihapa Yotamu akakembili, na kutilila kujenda ku muchi wa Beeli, akatami konihoku, maghambu akunjowipi Abimeleki ndongu waki.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimeleki akatawili inchi ja Izilaeli kwa chikahi cha hyaka itatu. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Chapanga akabhakolukili Abimeleki na bhandu bhaka Shekemu, nabhombi bhandu bhaka Shekemu bhakung'anambwiki Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Chapanga akabhalapwili bhandu bhaka Shekemu papamu na ndongu wabhu Abimeleki kubhokana na uhakau ghobhakabhatendili bhana sabini bha chikambaku bhaka Yelubaali. Utemulu wa ukomakeku hoghu ukabhapatiki maghambu Abimeleki akabhakomiki bhalongu bhaki kwa kujangatiwa na bhandu bhaka Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Panihapa bhandu bhaka Shekemu bhakabhabhekiki bhandu bha kunjobhalela Abimeleki na manjolinjoli bhaki panani ja tutombi, bhelabhela bhandu bhanihabha bhakabhanyawili hindu ya bhandu bhokapi bhabhakapetiki indela jeniheji pambipi nabhu, najombi Abimeleki akapwaghakiki mambu ghanihagha.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Bhela Gaali, mwana waka Ebedi, akapiti kutama ku Shekemu papamu na bhalongu bhaki, na bhandu bhaka Shekemu bhakabhili na uhobhalelu naku. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Bhakapiti kumighonda jabhu kuhuna zabibu na kubhundika zabibu heyi, na bhakalenganaki divai na kutenda uwangalalu. Bhakajingili mu nyumba jaka chapanga wabhu bhakakuliki na kunywa, na kuntondola Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gaali mwana waka Ebedi akapwaghike, “Bho, Abimeleki nde nane? Tepani bhandu bha muchi wa Shekemu nde bhandu bha ntundu bhole, mbaka tuntumakya Abimeleki? Bho, jombi nga mwana waka Yelubaali? Najombi Zebuli nga njangatila waki? Bhela mubhatumakyaje bhandu bhaka Hamoli, tati waka Shekemu. Bho, maghambu kiki tuntumakyaje Abimeleki? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Ngati nakabhi chiongozi wa bhandu habha bhokapi nakabya nuntendi Abimeleki ngaikubha nkolongwa. Nakabya numpwaghi Abimeleki, ‘Ujonjukyaje manjolinjoli ghaku, na uhikaje tukomanaje palongi ja bhandu na nepani ananukuwezaje!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebuli joakabhi mtawala wa muchi paakajowini malobhi ghaka Gaali, mwana waka Ebedi, akayomiki namaa. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Panihapa Zebuli akumpelaki utenga Abimeleki ku Tolama hoku na kumpwaghila, “Gaali, mwana waka Ebedi, papamu na bhalongu bhaki bhahikiki kutama pani pa Shekemu, na kuchochakela bhandu nahuli bhakukanaje. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Bhela ikilu jenu, wehapa papamu na bhandu bhaku, na muhikaje kujobhalela na kubhanyepa mwitengu ya pambipi na muchi wa Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Chilabhu lukela, palipita lyobha, ulapulaje muchi hoghu. Gaali payipitaje papamu na bhandu bhaki kuhika kukomana na mwehapa, ubhalapulaje ngati mowiwezilaje.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Abimeleki akabhokiki na bhandu bhabhakabhili papamu naku kuhika ku Shekemu chikahi cha ikilu. Akabhaghabhiki bhandu bhaki mu mapogha nchechi na kubhanyepa konihoku pambipi na muchi. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Bhela Gaali, mwana waka Ebedi akabhili apitiki kunja akajemiki pundyangu ukolongwa wa kujingalila mu muchi, chikahi hechi Abimeleki na bhandu bhaki bhakabhokiki na kupitalila kuhuma pandu pabhakabhili bhajobhalile. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gaali paakabhaweni bhandu habha, akumpwaghi Zebuli, “Lingalyaje! Bhandu bhahuluka kuhuma panani ja itombi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Zebuli akayangike, “Wehapa ulola mihwili ja itombi kubha ngati bhandu bhabhajenda.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Nambu Gaali akapwaghiki kabhete, “Lingalyaje! Bhandu bhahulukila pachilanda ja inchi na lipogha limu la bhandu lihika kwa upambala ghoubhili nkongu ukolongwa ghoulowakeka mwaloni wa Bhalondola!”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Panihapa Zebuli akumpwaghile, “Kubhi kwaku kulibhona kwaku heno? Bho wehapa le nga weukapwaghiki, ‘Abimeleki nde nane? Kwa ndandi kiki tuntumakyaje? Bhanihabha le nga bhandu bhala bhawajojwihe? Henu upitaje ukakomana nabhu!’ ” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Bhela Gaali akapitiki na kubhalongoha bhandu bhaka Shekemu kukomana na Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Nambu Abimeleki akuntopwili Gaali, najombi akatiliki palongi jaki, bhandu bhamaheli bhakapotakiki na kukomakeka mu indela mbaka pundyangu ukolongwa wa muchi. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Bhela Abimeleki akatami ku Aluma, najombi Zebuli akabhatopwili Gaali na bhalongu bhaki bhabhokaje mu muchi wa Shekemu.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Chilabhu jaki, Abimeleki akajowini kubha bhandu bha ku Shekemu bhakabhokiki mu muchi na kujenda mu mighonda. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Bhela akabhatoliki manjolinjoli bhaki, na kubhaghabha mapogha ghatatu, nabhombi bhakapiti kubhanyepalela mumighonda. Paakabhaweni bhandu bhahuma mu muchi, akabhokiki koakajobhalili, akabhalapwili na kubhakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimeleki na mapogha ghaki bhakapiti imbelu kujenda kuhibhalila ndyangu ukolongwa wa muchi, nahuli bhandu ngabhipeta kujingi mkati. Mapogha ghaki ghabheli ghakabhalapwili bhandu bhala bhabhakabhi mu mighonda na kubhakoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Abimeleki akakomini na bhandu bha muchi hoghu muhi jokapi. Akautoliki kwa makili muchi na kubhakoma bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhi monihomu. Akauyoningi muchi hoghu kwa moto na kuujeghela mwinyu.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Bhela bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhili bhatama mnala wa Shekemu pabhakajowini malobhi ghanihagha, bhakakembalili mu ngomi ja nyumba jaka chapanga joakalowakiki Eli Beliti. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abimeleki akapwaghakiki kubha bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhili ku mnala wa Shekemu bhahimangini papamu. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Abimeleki na bhandu bhokapi bhakapiti kuchitombi cha Salimoni, akatoliki libhaghu na kuheketa limbandi la nkongu, na kulibheka palibhegha laki. Panihapa akabhapwaghili bhandu bhaakabhi nabhu bhala, “Njombatikaje kutenda ngati mondendili nepani.” <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Kila mundu akahekiti limbandi ngati moakahekatili Abimeleki. Bhakatoliki mambandi ghabhu na kughajegheka mu lumatu lwa ngomi, bhakaghajochiki moto na kujijocha moto ngomi heji, bhandu bhokapi akanalomi na akambomba ngati bhandu elufu jinu bhabhakabhili ku mnala wa Shekemu bhakapotile.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Panihapa Abimeleki na manjolinjoli ghaki bhakapiti ku Tebesi, bhakuuyongalwiti muchi na kuutola kwa makili. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Nambu mkati ja muchi hoghu pakabhili na mnala ghouchengakiki nganganga. Henu bhandu bhokapi bha muchi hoghu akanalomi na akambomba, papamu na ihongozi bhabhu bhakatilili mkati jaki na kulijighalila ndyangu. Panihapa bhakakweliki panani ja nhwaghala wa mnala hoghu. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleki na bhandu bhaki bhakapiti ku mnala na kuulapula, nambu paakauheghalili ndyangu wa mnala hoghu nahuli kuuyonanga kwa moto, <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />mbomba jumu akalekili liganga la kuyaghila panani ja mmutu waka Abimeleki, lakakajwili lifuvu la mmutu waki. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Panihapa Abimeleki akundohiki manyata nkombu waki joakatotwili silaha yaki na kumpwaghila, “Tolaje lipanga laku na ungomaje, nahuli bhandu ngabhihika kupwagha, ‘Nakakomakiki na mbomba.’ ” Panihapa nkombu jola akunhotwi lipanga na kunkoma. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Bhaizilaeli pabhakaweni kubha Abimeleki apotili, bhakabhokiki na kubhuja kila mundu kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Bhenibhela nde Chapanga moakalepili kubhokana na uhakau ghola ambau Abimeleki akabhili autendiki kwaka tati waki, kwa kubhakoma bhalongu bhaki sabini. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Bhelabhela Chapanga akabhatendiki bhandu bhaka Shekemu bhalapulikaje kwa mahoku ghabhu ghabhakatendiki. Bhela, masolu ghaka Yotamu mwana waka Yelubaali ghakabhapatike.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Bhela paakapoti Abimeleki, Tola mwana waka Pua, nchokolu waka Dodo, wa likabila laka Isakali, joakabhi atama ku muchi wa Shamili, akapitalili na kubhakengalela Bhaizilaeli. Tola akabhili atama ku inchi ja itombi yaka Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Akabhi mtemula wa Bhaizilaeli kwa chikahi cha hyaka ishilini na itatu, akapotili na kutaghakika ku Shamili hoku.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Paakapotili Tola, akapitalili Yaili, Mgileadi, akabhili mtemula wa Bhaizilaeli kwa chikahi cha hyaka ishilini na ibheli. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Yaili akabhili na bhana bha chikambaku selasini bhabhakabhili bhajendesha maponda selasini. Nabhombi bhakabhili na michi selasini mu inchi ja Gileadi, ambaju mbaka lalenu jilowakeka Hawoti Yaili, yani ijiji yaka Yaili. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yaili akapotili, na kutaghakika ku Kamoni hoku.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yefita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki mahakau kabheti palongi ja mihu ghaka Bambo Chapanga. Bhakajojabhalili ichapanga ya Mabaali na Maashitoleti, ichapanga ya Shamu, yani Silia, ichapanga ya Sidoni, ichapanga ya Moabu, ichapanga ya Bhaamoli, na ichapanga ya Bhafilisti. Ndandi Bhaizilaeli bhakundekiki Bambo Chapanga wala ngachebhajendalili kuntumakila jombi. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Bhela inyela jaka Bambo Chapanga jakabhili kwa bhandu bha Izilaeli, najombi akabhalekiki bhakomakikaje na Bhafilisti na Bhaamoli. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Bhakabhang'ahiki na kubhabhonela Bhaizilaeli kwa chikahi cha hyaka komi na nane. Bhakabhabhonili bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhabhakabhili upambala wa kabheli wa nkoka Yoludani mu inchi ja Bhaamoli, jejibhili ku Gileadi hoku. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Bhaamoli nabhombi bhakalombwiki nkoka Yoludani nahuli kukomana na makabila gha Yuda, Benyamini, na Efulaimu. Nabhombi Bhaizilaeli bhakapatiki mang'ahiku namaa.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhakundelili Bambo Chapanga bhakapwaghaje, “Tepani tutendiki mahoku, kwa kubha tukulekiki wehapa wa Chapanga witu na kughajojabhela Mabaali.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Bambo Chapanga akabhayangike, “Bho, nepani le ngachenunkengalili mwehapa kuhuma kwa Bhamisili, Bhaamoli, Bhaamoni, na Bhafilisti? <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Bhasidoni, Bhaamaleki, na Bhamaoni pabhakumboni mwehapa na mwehapa mkanelili nepani na kulobha ujangatilu, bho, ngachenunkengalili kuhuma mu mabhoku ghabhu? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Nambu mwehapa mnekiki nepani na kuijojabhela ichapanga nayengi, kwa ndandi jeniheji nganunkengaleli kabheti. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Njendaje mkailelilaje ichapanga yela yemwihawili, na ichapanga yeniheyi yunkengalyaje mwehapa pamukubha mu mang'ahiku!”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Nambu Bhaizilaeli bhakumpwaghi Bambo Chapanga, “Tutendiki mahoku. Ututendilaje lela leulibhona kubha lamboni kwaku, nambu tukulobha, chondi, utukengalyaje lalenu.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Nabhombi bhakaibhohiki ichapanga ya chigheni pachilanda jabhu, na bhakunjojabhili Bambo Chapanga. Na Chapanga ngacheakaweziki kujendalela kuhinakila nakanopi kubhona mang'ahiku gha Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Bhaamoni bhakalibhongini na kubheka likambi labhu ku Gileadi hoku. Bhandu bha Izilaeli nabhombi bhakalibhongini na kubheka likambi labhu ku Misipa hoku. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Panihapa Bhaizilaeli na ihongozi bha bhandu, bhakalalukanile, “Bho, nde nane joanatumbulaje kukomana na Bhaamoni? Joayitendaje bhenibhela nde joanakubhaje chiongozi wa bhandu bhokapi bhabhatama ku Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Bhela ku Gileadi hoku kukabhili na mundu jumu nkomana ngondu wa wichu joakalowakiki Yefita, mwana waka mubhu jumu nkemi, na tati waki akalowakiki Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Gileadi akabhili na bhana bhangi kwaka nhwanu waki wa halali. Bhana bhaka mbomba hoju pabhakakoliki, bhakuntopwili Yefita panyumba, na kumpwaghila, “Wehapa ngacheubhili na pandu pa upwelelu kuhuma kwaka tati witu, maghambu wehapa nde wa mwana waka mbomba najongi.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Panihapa Yefita akabhatiliki bhalongu bhaki na kujenda kutama mu inchi ja Tobu, konihoku bhandu bha liyaha bhakalombini naku na kunjengalela.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Pachapetiki chikahi chichokopi, bhandu bha likabila la Bhaamoni bhakakomini na Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Chikahi bhandu bha likabila la Bhaamoni pabhakabhili bhakomana ngondu na Bhaizilaeli, bhazee bhaka Gileadi bhakapiti kuntola Yefita mu inchi ja Tobu. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Bhakumpwaghili Yefita, “Hikaje utulonguhaje mu ngondu jitu na Bhaamoni.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Nambu Yefita akabhayangike, “Bho, ngachemwanhakalili nepani na kundopola mu nyumba jaka tati wangu? Bho, maghambu kiki munhikila sajenu, chikahi pambi mu mang'ahiku?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Bhazee bhaka Gileadi bhakumpwaghili Yefita, “Nambu sajenu tung'anambwiki kukujengalela wehapa, nahuli ubya papamu na tepani kukomana na Bhaamoni, na wehapa ukubhaje wa chiongozi witu na bhandu bhokapi bhaka Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefita akabhapwahili bhazee bhaka Gileadi habha, “Ngati anamungelawihi kunyumba kukomana na Bhaamoni, najombi Bambo Chapanga anaanyangatili kubhaweza Bhaamoni, bho, nde chakaka lelu anangubha chiongozi winu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Bhazee bhaka Gileadi bhakamuyangiki Yefita, “Bambo Chapanga nde mlandilu witu. Chakaka anatutendaje ngati moupwaghile.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Panihapa Yefita akapiti na bhazee bhaka Gileadi, na bhandu bhakuntendiki kubha chiongozi na nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli ghabhu. Najombi Yefita akakelabhukili malobhi ghaki ghokapi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga ku Misipa hoku.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Bhela, Yefita akapeliki utenga kwaka nkolongwa wa Bhaamoni akapwaghaje, “Bho, wehapa ubhi na kike mbaka uhikiki kujilapula inchi jitu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Nkolongwa wa Bhaamoni akabhayangiki bhatenga bhaka Yefita bhala, “Bhaizilaeli pabhakabhokiki ku Misili, bhakatoliki inchi jangu kutumbula nkoka Alinoni mbaka nkoka Yaboki, na mbaka nkoka Yoludani. Bhela ungelabhukyaje inchi yeniheyi kabheti kwa lukwali.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefita akabhatumiki bhatenga mala ja kabheli kujenda kwaka nkolongwa wa Bhaamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />akumpwaghile, “Yefita akupwaghi anana: Bhaizilaeli ngachebhakatoliki inchi ja Moabu, wala inchi ja Bhaamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Nambu Bhaizilaeli pabhakabhokiki ku Misili, bhakapetili mu chingwenji mbaka Bahali ja Shamu, na kuhika ku Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhakatumiki bhatenga kwaka nkolongwa wa Edomu, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Utujetakyaje kupeta mu inchi jako.’ Nambu nkolongwa wa Edomu akakaniki. Bhakapeliki utenga kwaka nkolongwa wa Moabu, najombi akakaniki. Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakatami ku Kadeshi hoku. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki mwanja kupetela lipololu kuyongolota inchi ja Edomu na Moabu mbaka pabhakahikiki upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Moabu, na kubheka likambi labhu kwihi ja nkoka Alinoni. Nambu ngachebhakajingili mkati ja malindakilu gha Moabu. Nkoka Alinoni ukabhili nde malindakilu gha Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakatumiki bhatenga kwaka Sihoni nkolongwa wa Bhaamoli, joakabhili atawala ku Heshiboni, na kumpwaghila, ‘Utujetakyaje kupeta mu inchi jaku, nahuli tujenda ku inchi jitu.’ <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Nambu Sihoni ngacheakabhajetakili Bhaizilaeli bhapetaje mu inchi jaki. Panihapa Sihoni akabhongini bhandu bhaki bhokapi, akabhekiki likambi ku Yahasa hoku, na kukomana na Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, akuntendiki Sihoni na bhandu bhaki bhokapi kulepalela palongi ja Bhaizilaeli. Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakatawili inchi jokapi ja Bhaamoli, bhabhakabhili bhatama mu inchi jeniheji. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Bhakatoliki pandu pokapi pa Bhaamoli kutumbula ku nkoka Alinoni mbaka ku nkoka Yaboki, na kutumbula ku chingwenji upambala wa kolipita lyobha mbaka ku nkoka Yoludani upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, akabhatopwili Bhaamoli palongi ja Bhaizilaeli. Bho, wehapa le upala kutunyaghula inchi jitu? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Bho, ngacheikupalika kutola chela ambachu chapanga waku Kemoshi atehi kukupekeha? Nambu inchi jokapi ambaju Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, atupekihi tepani, inchi heji nde jitu. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Bho, wehapa ubhi na makili kupeta Balaki mwana waka Sipoli, joakabhili nkolongwa wa Moabu? Bho, jombi le akakomini na Bhaizilaeli au kulochana nabhu chikahi chokapi chela? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Chikahi chokapi Bhaizilaeli pabhatamikaje mu muchi wa Heshiboni na ijiji yaki, na muchi wa Aloeli na ijiji yaki, papamu na michi jokapi jejibhili munkeghi ja nkoka Alinoni kwa chikahi cha hyaka mia tatu, bho, maghambu kiki mwehapa ngachemwatoliki pandu panihapa mu chikahi cheniheche? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Nepani ngachenukuhokili lijambu lokapi lela, nambu wehapa nde weunihokihi kwa kukomana ngondu na nepani. Bhela Bambo Chapanga joabhili Mtemula, lalenu na atemulaje ngondu pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli na Bhaamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Nambu nkolongwa wa Bhaamoni, ngacheakajowanili utenga waka Yefita hoghu.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Panihapa Roho waka Bambo Chapanga akunhikili Yefita. Najombi akabhokiki na kupeta pachilanda ja Gileadi na Manase, akakelawiki ku Misipa mu inchi ja Gileadi na kujendalela kujenda kukomana na Bhaamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yefita akabhekiki nazili kwaka Bambo Chapanga akapwaghaje, “Ngati anaubhatendiki Bhaamoni kulepalela palongi jangu, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />chokapi chela chenachipitaje pandyangu wa nyumba jangu cha kutumbula nahuli kunyopalela pangelabhuka kwa lukwali mu kubhaweza Bhaamoni, anachikubha chaka Bambo Chapanga na ananichibhohaje kubha nyambiku ja kujochakeka.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Panihapa Yefita akalombwiki kukomana na Bhaamoni habha, najombi Bambo Chapanga akabhatendiki Bhaamoni kulepalela palongi jaka Yefita. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Akabhalapwili namaa na kubhaweza kutumbula ku Aloeli mbaka pambipi na Miniti na kujendalela mbaka ku Abeli Kelamimu, michi jokapi jejakalapuliki jakabhi ishilini. Panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhakabhaweziki Bhaamoni.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamwali waka Yefita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Bhela Yefita paakakelawiki kunyumba jaki ku Misipa hoku, kamwali waki akapitiki kuhika kunjopalela koni akahinaje na kuhona kang'oma. Kamwali hoju akabhili nde mwana waki wa kanjika. Yefita ngacheakabhili na mwana jongi wa chikambaku wala mwali. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Yefita paakumbweni, akahuliki ingobhu jaki na kulela, “Wenga wa mwali wangu! Undendiki ngubhaje mabhinilu gha ntima. Wehapa ubhili jumu wa bhala bhabhaning'aha. Nyomwili kulapa kwaka Bambo Chapanga, nanatu nganhwezi kuheketa chela chenapiki.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Kamwali waki akumpwaghile, “Tati wangu, upwaghiki lilobhi laku kwaka Bambo Chapanga, undendilaje nepani ngati bhela moupwaghile, kwa ndandi Bambo Chapanga akupekihi kubhaweza maadui bhaku Bhaamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Najombi akumpwaghili tati waki, “Nobha undendilaje lijambu alele. Umbekyaje myehi jibheli nahuli nyendaje na bhakochi bhangu ku itombi, nakaulelilaje umwali wangu maghambu nepani anambotilaje mangani ja kutoghuleka.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Tati waki akumpwaghile, “Uweza kujenda.” Najombi akundekiki ajendaje kwa myehi jibheli. Panihapa akabhokiki papamu na akakamwali bhajaki, najombi akaulelili umwali waki ku itombi hoku kwa ndandi ngaakatoghuliki ng'o. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Pajakajomwiki myehi jibheli heji, akakelawiki kwaka tati waki, najombi tati waki akuntendili ngati moakabhili abhohiki chilanga chaki. Najombi akabhili mwali bikila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Henu kutumbula chikahi hechi kukabhili na ntetu hoghu mu Izilaeli, <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />kila chaka akakamwali bha Izilaeli bhakabhili bhajenda kwa machobha nchechi nahuli kunkomboka kamwali waka Yefita paakapotile ku Gileadi hoju.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Yefita na likabila la Bhaefulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Efulaimu bhakabhongini manjolinjoli ghabhu, na kulomboka kujenda ku Zafoni, bhakumpwaghili Yefita, “Bho, maghambu kiki upiti kukomana na Bhaamoni panga kutuloha nahuli tujendaje papamu na wenga? Henu anatujocha motu nyumba jaku, papamu na wamweti ukabya mkati jaki.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Yefita akabhapwaghile, “Nepani na bhandu bhangu tukabhili na malochanu makolongwa na Bhaamoni, nakundobhiki muhikaje munyangatyaje nambu ngachemukahikiki kungengalela palongi jabhu. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Panakabhoniki kubha ngachemkambekihi ujangatilu, nepani nakabhi mu hatali ja kupotela, na nakalombwiki kukomana na Bhaamoni. Najombi Bambo Chapanga akambekihi uwezu wa kubhaweza bhombi. Henu, bho, maghambu kike mnihikili lalenu nahuli kukomana na nepane?” <verse eid="JDG 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Panihapa Yefita akabhabhongini bhandu bhokapi bhaka Gileadi, na kukomana na bhandu bhaka Efulaimu. Bhagileadi bhakabhaweziki bhandu bhaka Efulaimu, kwa kubha Bhaefulaimu bhakapwaghike, “Mwehapa Bhagileadi nde mwentiliki kuhuma mu likabila laka Efulaimu na Manase.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Bhagileadi bhakakamwili ilombukelu ya nkoka Yoludani nahuli kuhibhalila indela ya kupeta Bhaefulaimu habha, panihapa ikabhili kila chikahi anahikiki mundu joatila ngondo na kulobha kulomboka, bhandu bha Gileadi bhakundalukili, “Bho wehapa le nde Mwefulaimu?” Ngati akayangiki, “Ngabhela,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />bhakumpwaghile, “Haya, upwagha Shiboleti.” Nambu jombi ngacheakapwaghiki, “Siboleti,” Kwa ndandi ngacheakaweziki kuloghola lilobhi heli wichu, bhakunkamwili na kunkoma pa ilombukelu ya Yoludani hapa. Bhaefulaimu elufu alubaini na bhabheli bhakakomakiki chikahi hechi.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yefita akabhili mtemula wa Bhaizilaeli kwa hyaka sita. Panihapa Yefita akapotili, akataghakiki mu ghumu wa michi ja Gileadi.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibizani, Eloni na Abidoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Bhela paakajomwiki Yefita, Ibizani wa ku Beselehemu akabhili mtemula wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Jombi akabhili na bhana selasini bha chikambaku na bhana selasini bha chimbomba. Akabhatendiki akakamwali bhaki bhatoghulikaje kwa bhandu bhangi kunja ja lukolu lwaki, na bhana bhaki bha chikambaku akabhatoghukili akambomba selasini kuhuma kunja ja lukolu lwaki. Ibizani akabhili mtemula wa Izilaeli kwa chikahi cha hyaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Ibizani akapotili, na akataghakiki ku Beselehemu hoku.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Paghakapetiki ghanihagha, Eloni, wa likabila laka Zabuloni, akabhili ntemula wa Izilaeli kwa hyaka komi. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Bhela Eloni akapotili, akataghakiki mu Aiyaloni, mu inchi ja Zabuloni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Paghakapetiki ghanihagha, Abidoni mwana waka Hileli, kuhuma mu muchi wa Pilatoni, akabhili ntemula wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Najombi akabhili na bhana alobaini, na bhachokolu selasini, bhabhakabhili bhajendesha maponda sabini, akabhili ntemula wa Bhaizilaeli kwa chikahi cha hyaka nane. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Panihapa Abidoni mwana waka Hileli, kuhuma mu muchi wa Pilatoni, akapotili na kutaghakika ku Pilatoni mu Efulaimu, mu inchi ja itombi ya Bhaamaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Kubhelakeka kwaka Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Bhaizilaeli bhakatendiki kabheti uhakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na Bambo Chapanga akabhalekiki bhatawaliwaje na Bhafilisti kwa chikahi cha hyaka alubaini.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Bhela kukabhi na mundu jumu wa ku Sola, wa likabila laka Dani, lihina laki akalowakiki Manoa. Nhwanu waki akabhi ngulumba. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Lichobha limu, mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga akumpitalili mbomba hoju na kumpwaghila, “Wehapa wa ngulumba na ngacheubheleka, nambu anaupata chitumbu na anaulibhopulaje mwana wa chikambaku. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Bhela ulilingalyaje namaa ngawikunywa divai wala uwembi, wala ngawikula chindu chokapi chela chechibhi chihakau. <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />Kwa ndandi anaupata chitumbu na anaumbelakaje mwana wa chikambaku. Majunju ghaka mwana hoju ngaghimoghakeki ng'o, maghambu anakubha atengakiki kwa ndandi ja lihengu laka Bambo Chapanga kutumbula kubhelakeka kwaki. Najombi anatumbulaje kubhakengalela Bhaizilaeli kuhuma mu utawala wa Bhafilisti.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Panihapa mbomba hoju akapiti kumpwaghi ndomi waki, “Mundu waka Chapanga akanhikili. Pamihu jaki pakabhili ngati ubhonikanu waka mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga, akabhili wa kujoghuheka namaa. Ngachenakundalukili koahumiki wala ngacheakambwaghi lihina laki. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Nambu akambwaghi kubha anambata chitumbu na anamelaka mwana wa chikambaku. Akanganakili nganikunywa divai wala uwembi, wala nganikula chindu chokapi chela chechibhi chihakau. Maghambu mwana hoju anakubha atengakiki kuhenga lihengu laka Chapanga kutumbula kubhelakeka kwaki, mbaka lichobha la kupotela kwaki.”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Panihapa Manoa akundobhiki Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje: “Chondi Bambo Chapanga nukulobha, mundu waka Chapanga jountumiki kwitu hoju ahikaje kabheti nahuli atubholaje ntundu wa kundela mwana hoju joanabhelakikaje.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Chapanga akalijowini lilobhu laka Manoa, najombi mtumika wa kunani waka Chapanga jola akunhikili kabheti mbomba jola paakabhili kungonda, nambu Manoa, ndomi waka mbomba hoju ngacheakabhile. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Bhela mbomba jola akapiti manyata, na akumpwaghili ndomi waki, “Lingalyaje! Mundu jola joakanhikili lichobha lela, ambitalili kabhete.”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manoa akajinwiki na kulongana na nhwanu waki mbaka kwaka mundu jola, na kundalukila mundu jola, “Bho, wehapa le nde mundu jola joukalongili na nhwanu wango?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Mundu jola akayangike, “Ena, nde nepane.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Panihapa Manoa akundalukile, “Chikahi malobhi ghaku paghipitalyaje, bho, nde mambu bholi ghatwihengaje kwa ndandi jaka mwana hoju? Bho, lihengu laka mwana hoju analikubha kike?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga akamuyangiki Manoa, “Nhwanu waku impalika kuhenga ghokapi ghala ghanumpwaghilaje. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Ngaikula chindu chokapi chela chechipitaje mu zabibu ng'o, wala ngaikunywa divai wala ngaikunywa uwembi, wala kula chindu chokapi chela chechibhi chihakau. Ghokapi ghanukulaghalakili, ughajengalyaje.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa akumpwaghili mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga jola, “Chondi nukulobha, utamaje pachokopi nahuli tuwezaje kukuandalila likenda la imbuhi kwa ndandi jaku.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga jola akumpwaghili Manoa, “Hata ngati unyomalakela kutama, nganguli chindu chokapi chela kwaku. Nambu ngati anaupala, utayalishaje nyambiku ja kujochakeka, umbokihaje Bambo Chapanga.” Manoa ngacheakamanyi kubha jonihoju akabhili mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Panihapa Manoa akundalukili mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga jola, “Bho, lihina laku nde nane, nahuli tuwezaje kukupekeha utopelu chikahi paghipitalyaje mambu ghala ghaulongile?”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga akumuyangike, “Bho, maghambu kike unalukila lihina langu? Lihina langu nde la kukangacha.”<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Panihapa Manoa akalitoliki likenda la imbuhi, papamu na nyambiku ja uhembi, najombi akumbokili Bambo Chapanga nyambiku panani ja litalaghu. Najombi mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo Chapanga jola akatendiki lijambu la kukangacha chikahi Manoa na nhwanu waki bhakabya bhalingalila. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Manoa na nhwanu waki pabhakabhi bhalingalila myengi ja motu jakakwelaje kunani kumahundi kuhuma pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, bhakumbweni mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga mu myengi heji akakwelaje kujenda kunani kumahundi. Panihapa Manoa na nhwanu waki bhakachikimi na kunjojabhalela. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga ngacheakumpitalili kabheti Manoa na nhwanu waki. Panihapa Manoa akamanyi kubha jonihoju akabhili mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Manoa akumpwaghi nhwanu waki, “Chakaka anatupotilaje, maghambu tumbweni Chapanga!”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Nambu nhwanu waki akamuyangike, “Ngati Bambo Chapanga akapaliki kutukoma, ngaakajetakili nyambiku jitu ja kujochakeka na ja chilebhi, wala ngaakatulangihi mambu ngati aghagha chikahi chenu.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Bhela nhwanu waka Manoa akalibhopwili mwana wa chikambaku, najombi Manoa akundohiki lihina Samsoni. Mwana akakoliki, najombi Bambo Chapanga akupengalile. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Roho waka Bambo Chapanga akatumbwi kuhenga lihengu mkati jaki chikahi paakabhili ku likambi la likabila laka Dani hoku, pachilanda ja muchi wa Sola na muchi wa Eshitaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni na mbomba kuhuma ku Timuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Lichobha limu Samsoni akapiti ku Timuna, na konihoku akumbweni mbomba wa Kifilisti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Paakakelawiki kunyumba akabhapwaghili bhabheleka bhaki, “Numbweni kamwali jumu Mfilisti ku Timuna huko. Mbala kuntoghola kamwali hoju. Njendaye mukuntolaje abya nhwanu wangu.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Nambu bhabheleka bhaki bhakundalukile, “Bho, ngacheabhili kamwali jokapi pachilanda ja bhalongu bhaku au pachilanda ja bhandu bhitu mbaka ujendaje kutoghola kwa Bhafilisti bhangakuheketa jando?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Nambu Samsoni akumpwaghili tati waki, “Mundoghukyaje kamwali hoju, maghambu numpala namaa.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Bhabheleka bhaki ngachebhakamanyi kubha lijambu heli lakabhili mpangu waka Bambo Chapanga, maghambu akabhili alonda ndandi ja kubhalapula Bhafilisti. Ndandi chikahi hechi, Bhafilisti bhakabhili bhabhatawala Bhaizilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Samsoni na bhabheleka bhaki bhakabhokiki kujenda ku Timuna. Pabhakahikiki ku mighonda ja mizabibu hoku, lingalyaje, palapala mwana lihimba akunhikili na kungulumila Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Roho waka Bambo Chapanga akumpekihi makili Samsoni, najombi akalikamwili na kulikajula ndomu wa lihimba lela kwa mabhoku ghaki panga kutumi chindu chokapi ngati bhela mundu moakajulila mwana mbuhi, wala ngacheakumpwaghili tati waki wala mabhu waki lijambu heli.<verse eid="JDG 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Panihapa akahelili kujenda kulongela na kamwali jola, kamwali jola akunyambihi namaa Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Paghakapetiki machobha machokopi Samsoni akapiti ku Timuna kuntola kamwali jola, paakabhili mwindela akabhetwiki kuulola ntuhi wa lihimba ghola, lingalyaje, kukabhili na injuchi na busi. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Bhela, akatoliki busi kwa mabhoku ghaki akabya akula koni akajendalya na mwanja waki. Paakahikiki kwa bhabheleka bhaki, akabhapekihi busi uchokopi nabhombi bhakakuliki. Nambu ngacheakabhapwaghili kubha ngati busi heji akapakwili mkati ja ntuhi wa lihimba.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Bhela tati waka Samsoni akapiti kunyumba jaka kamwali jola kubhoha mahali, najombi Samsoni akatendiki uhangalalu konihoku, ngati mobhayobhalili kuhenga mu chikahi chenihechi. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Bhafilisti pabhukumbweni Samsoni bhakundetili akakombu selasini atama nabhu. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samsoni akabhapwaghile, “Ananumpekya chitendawili. Ngati anamuweziki kufyatula chitendawili hechi mu chikahi cha machobha saba gha uwangalalu wa ndowa, nepani ananumpekya ingobhu selasini ya langi jihuhu na ingobhu yengi selasini ya uwangalalu wa ndowa. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Nambu anandepalili kufyatula chitendawili hechi, mwehapa anambekyaje nepani ingobhu selasini ya langi jihuhu na ingobhu yengi selasini ya kuwata pa uwangalalu wa ndowa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Bhakumpwaghile, “Haya, utupwaghilaje chitendawili hechi, nahuli tupata kujowana.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Samsoni akabhapwaghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Mkati jaka mundu joakula kukapitiki chilebhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">mkati jaka mwana makili kukapitiki chindu chinohu.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">Kwa chikahi cha machobha ghatatu ngachebhakaweziki kubhoha liyangu.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Lichobha la saba, bhakumpwaghili nhwanu waka Samsoni, “Mpembalyaje ndomi waku nahuli atumpwaghilaje ndandi ja chitendawili hechi, nangabhela anatukujocha motu wehapa na nyumba jaka tati waku. Bho, mtukokiki pambani nahuli mpata kutunyaghula mali ghito?” <verse eid="JDG 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Panihapa nhwanu waka Samsoni akaleliki palongi jaki Samsoni na kumpwaghila, “Utenda kunhakalila! Ngacheumbala hata pachokopi. Ubhapendakili bhandu bhangu chitendawili, nambu nepani ngacheumbwaghili liyangu laki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Samsoni akumpwaghile, “Nepani ngachenabhapwaghili hata bhabheleka bhangu. Bho, henu ananhweza bholi kukupwaghi wehapa?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Nhwanu waka Samsoni akaleliki mu machobha ghokapi saba ghala gha uwangalalu wa ndowa. Lichobha la saba lela Samsoni akumpwaghili nhwanu waki ndandi ja chitendawili chela kwa ndandi akabhili andobha namaa. Najombi nhwanu waka Samsoni akapiti kubhapwaghila bhandu bhaki ndandi ja chitendawili chela. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Lichobha la saba heli mangani ja kujibhi lyobha, bhandu bha muchi ghola bhakumpwaghi Samsoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Bho, nde chindu bholi chinohu kupeta busi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Bho, nde nani joabhi na makili kupeta lihimba?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:18">Samsoni akabhapwaghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Ngati ngamwakunkolwihi nchumba wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">ngamwakaweziki kufyatula chitendawili changu.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Palapala Roho waka Bambo Chapanga akuntendiki Samsoni kubha na makili namaa. Najombi akapiti mbaka ku Ashikeloni, akabhakomiki bhandu akanalomi selasini, na kubhahula ingobhu yabhu ya kuwata pa uwangalalu wa ndowa, na kubhapekeha bhandu bhala bhabhakafyatwili chitendwili chaki. Panihapa akabhokiki na kujenda kunyumba ja bhabheleka bhaki koni akabya na inyela namaa. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Nambu nhwanu waka Samsoni bhakuntoghukili nkombu jumu, joakabhili njemalela chikahi cha uwangalalu wa ndowa jaki.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Chikahi chichokopi pachapetiki, chikahi cha mahunu gha inganu, Samsoni akatoliki likenda la imbuhi, na kujenda kumbona nhwanu waki. Akumpwaghili nkohanu waki wa chikambaku kubha, “Mbala kumbona nhwanu wangu kuchumba chaki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:1">Nambu nkohanu waki wa chikambaku hoju akunkanakili ngayijingila. <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Nkohanu waka Samsoni wa chikambaku akumpwaghili Samsoni, “Nepani nhambukya kubha unhakalili namaa, henu nuntoghukili nkochi waku. Bho, nung'una waki wa chimbomba le nga mnyahi nakanopi kupeta jombe? Chondi untoghula jonihojo pandu paki.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samsoni akabhapwaghile, “Henu, cheananabhahengila Bhafilisti chikahi chenu, nganikubhi na lawama.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Panihapa Samsoni akapiti kukamula mabweha mia tatu na akaghakongiki mikela jabhu papamu bhabheli bhabheli. Akakongiki myengi ja moto kila libhongelu la mabweha. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Akapambakili myengi heji moto na kughalekakela mabweha ghala, na mabweha ghanihagha ghakajingili mu mighonda ja Bhafilisti na kuyonanga makenda gha inganu na inganu yeyakabhili ikona ngacheihunakiki papamu na mighonda ja mizeituni. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Panihapa Bhafilisti bhakalalukile, “Bho, nde nane joatendiki lijambu lenihele?” Bhakabhapwaghile, “Nde Samsoni, nkohanu waka Mtimna jola, atendiki bhenibhela kwa ndandi nkohanu waki wa chikambaku hoju antoliki nhwanu waka Samsoni na kuntoghukela nkombu jumu joakabhili njemalela wa uwangalalu wa ndowa jaka Samsoni.” Bhela Bhafilisti bhakapiti kubhakoma kwa kubhanjocha moto mbomba jola papamu na tati waki.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samsoni akabhapwaghili Bhafilisti, “Kwa ndandi mtendiki bhenibhela, chakaka napa kubha ngamoki mbaka nunkelabhukyaje.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Panihapa Samsoni akabhalapwili nakanopi na kubhakoma bhandu bhamaheli namaa. Bhela Samsoni akapiti kutama mu likolu la litalaghu la ku Etama.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni abhaweza Bhafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Bhela manjolinjoli bha Bhafilisti bhakahikiki na kubheka likambi ku Yuda hoku na kuulapula muchi wa Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Bandu bha Yuda bhakabhalalukile, “Bho, maghambu kiki muhikiki kutulapu tepane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Bhakayangike, “Tuhikiki nahuli kunkamula Samsoni na kuntendela ngati moatutendile tepane.”<verse eid="JDG 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Panihapa bhandu elufu itatu bha Yuda bhakunjendili Samsoni mu likolu lelibhili mu litalaghu la ku Etamu, na kupwaghila, “Bho, ngacheumanyi kubha Bhafilisti bhatutawala? Bho, nde kiki cheniheche cheututendile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">Samsoni akabhayangike, “Ngati mobhakandendili nepani, na nepani nabhatendili bhelabhela.”<verse eid="JDG 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Bhakumpwaghile, “Tuhikiki kukukonga nahuli tukupelakaje kwa Bhafilisti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Samsoni akabhapwaghile, “Mnapilaje kubha mwehapa mabheti ngamwingomi.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Bhakamuyangike, “Tepani ngatukukomi, nambu anatukukonga pela na kukupeleka kwabhu.” Bhela bhakunkongiki kwa mighoji jibheli jahenu, na kumpiha mu likolu heli.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Paakahikiki ku Lehi, Bhafilisti bhakunhikili koni bhakalapula njobhela. Palapala Roho waka Bambo Chapanga akunjeghili makili Samsoni. Na mighoji jebhakankongiki mu mabhoku jaki jela ikahekatiki ngati ingobhu jihuhu jejijochakiki kwa moto, na hifungu yaki ikahawili pahi kuhuma mu mabhoku ghaki. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Panihapa Samsoni akaliweni lihupa libhehi la ndomu wa pahi wa liponda, akahatambwili chiwoku chaki, na akatoliki lihupa lela na kubhakoma bhandu elufu jimu. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Panihapa Samsoni akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Kwa lihupa la liponda nabhatendiki kubha ngati lipogha la maponda mongini mapogha gha mituhi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">Kwa lihupa la liponda nabhakomiki bhandu elufu jimu.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Paakajomwili kupwagha, akalilekili lihupa lela. Pandu pala pakalohakiki “Lamati Lehi,” yani “Katombi ka Lihupa.”<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Panihapa Samsoni akabhi na inywita namaa, henu akundobhiki Bambo Chapanga akapwaghaje, “Wehapa nde weuletiki ukombola hoghu, kwa kupetela kwaka mtumika waku. Bho, henu anauneka nguhaje kwa inywita na kukamulika na Bhafilisti bhangakucheku jandu habha?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Chapanga akahowili pandu papakabhili na libhomba ku Lehi hoku, machi ghakapitiki. Samsoni paakakunywiki machi ghanihagha, makili ghaki ghakunkelubhukili na akahekalile. Henu chemichemi jela jakalohakiki Eni Hakole, yani mundu joaloha kupala ujangatilu, najombi chemichemi heji jikali jibhi mbaka lalenu ku Lehi huko.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Bhela Samsoni akabhili ntemula wa Bhaizilaeli kwa hyaka ishilini, chikahi cha Bhafilisti.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samsoni ajenda ku Gaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Lichobha limu Samsoni akapiti ku Gaza, akahimangini na mbomba jumu nkemi, na kughone kwaki. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Bhandu bha ku Gaza pabhakapwaghakiki, kubha Samsoni abhili konihoko. Bhela bhakayongalwiti pandu pala na kujobhalela pundyangu ukolongwa wa muchi. Bhakatumbili chinunu kelukelu ngwe, bhakapwaghaje, “Tunjobhalyaje mbaka pachibhombu, panihapa anatunkomaje.” <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Nambu Samsoni akaghonilii mbaka ikilu pamahiku. Chikahi cha ikilu pamahiku akajumwiki na kukamula ngelaketi ibheli ya milyangu, akaitupwili papamu na makabali ghaki na akaghatotwili na kujenda naghu mbaka pambipi na Hebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsoni na Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Paghapetiki ghanihagha, Samsoni akumpaliki mbomba jumu joalohakikaje Delila ambuju kabhi atama mu libondi la Soleki. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Ihongozi bha Bhafilisti bhakunjendi Delila na kumpwaghila, “Umpembalakya Samsoni nahuli akupwaghilaje chindu chechuntenda akubha na makili ghamaheli na ntundu motwiwezilaje kunkamula na kunkonga. Anautendiki bhenibhela, kila jumu witu anaakumpekyaje hipandi elufu jimu na mia jimu ya madini gha feza.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Delila akumpwaghi Samsoni, “Chondi nukulobha umbwaghilaje nde chindu bholi chechukutenda ukubhaje na makili kwa ndundu aghoghu. Bho, mundu aweza bholi kukuweza na kukukamula na kukung'aha?”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samsoni akayangike, “Ngati anabhangongiki kwa mighoji saba ambaju jikona ngachejijomiki, panihapa anangubha njeta makili ngati mundu jongi jokapi jola.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Panihapa ihongozi bha Bhafilisti bhakundetili Delila mighoji saba mibhei, najombi akunkongiki Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Delila akabhili abhekiki bhandu nahuli bhunjobhalyaje mu chumba chengi. Bhela akumpwaghili Samsoni kwa sauti ngolongwa, “Samsoni, Bhafilisti bhahika kukulapula!” Nambu jombi akajihekiti mighoji jela ngati uzi wa pamba paukupa moto. Bhela sili ja makili ghaki ngachejamanyakini.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Panihapa Delilia akumpwaghi Samsoni, “Wehapa undendili chihongolu na kumbwaghila upuhi. Chondi nukulobha umbwaghilaje, bho, uweza kukongakeka na chindu bhole?”<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Samsoni akamyangike, “Anabhangongiki kwa mighoji jahenu jangakutumika, anangubha njeta makili ngati mundu jongi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Delila akatoliki mighoji jahenu na kunkonga naju Samsoni. Panihapa akumpwaghi Samsoni kwa sauti ngolongwa, “Samsoni! Bhafilisti bhahikiki kukulapula!” Bhandu bhala bhabhakabhili bhunjobhalela Samsoni bhakabhili mu chumba chengi. Nambu akajihekiti mighoji jela jeakabhili akongakiki mu mabhoku ghaki ngati aheketa uzi.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila akumpwaghi Samsoni, “Mbaka sajenu ukona undendela chihongolu na kumbwaghila upuhi. Umbwaghilaje, bho, uweza kukongakeka na chindu bhole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Samsoni akamuyangike, “Ngati anaulokiki mabutu saba gha majunju gha mmutu wangu na kungonga papamu na chitambala cha mbumbu na kukaza nakanopi pa mpengu wa chitanda, anangubha njeta makili ngati mundu jongi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Chikahi Samsoni paakabhili aghonili Delila akalokiki mabutu saba gha majunju ghaka Samsoni akaghakongiki kwa chitambala cha mbumbu na kughakaza namaa kwa litendeghu. Panihapa akumpwaghi Samsoni, “Samsoni! Bhafilisti bhahika kukulapula!” Nambu akajumwiki mu lughonu na kuholamola mpengu wa chitanda chela na chitambala cha mbumbu chela.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Panihapa Delila akumpwaghili Samsoni, “Bho, uweza bholi kupwagha, ‘Nukupala,’ koni mtima waku ngacheubhi papamu na nepani? Undendili chihongolu mala katatu na ngacheumbwaghili sili ja makili ghaku ghamaheli.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Bhela, Delila akajendalili kung'aha namaa Samsoni kwa malobhi ghanihagha lichobha kwa lichobha na kunhyomela, roho jaki jakang'ahakiki pambipi ja kupotela. <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Panihapa Samsoni akumpwaghi Delila sili ja makili ghaki, akumpwaghile, “Chijembi ngachechipetiki ng'o pamutu jangu, kwa ndandi nepani nde muhaghulika waka Chapanga kutumbula mulutumbu lwaka mabhu wangu. Ngati majunju gha mmutu wangu anaghamoghakiki, makili ghangu anaghamokaje, na anangubhaje njeta makili ngati mundu jongi jokapi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Bhela Delila paakamanyiki kubha Samsoni andandili ghokapi ghaghakabhili muntima waki, Delila akatumiki utenga kwa ihongozi bha Bhafilisti na kupwagha, “Mhikaje kabhete, maghambu chikahi chenjenu Samsoni anandili mambu ghaki ghokapi.” Panihapa ihongozi bha Bhafilisti bhakunjendi Delila, koni bhakabya na madini gha feza mu mabhoku ghabhu. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Najombi Delila akuntendiki Samsoni aghonilaje lughonu pamajuwa ghaki, akundohiki mundu amoghaje mabutu saba gha majunju gha kumutu jaki ghala. Delila akatumbwili kung'aha Samsoni nahuli ajumukaje, nambu makili ghaka Samsoni ghakabhokiki. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Delila akunjumwihi Samsoni, “Samsoni! Bhafilisti bhahika kukulapula!” Samsoni akajumwiki mu luwonu koni akaholalyaje kubha anaapitaje kunja na kulikengalela ngati pakutumbala hapa. Nambu ngacheakamanyi kubha Bambo Chapanga andekike. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Bhafilisti bhakunkamwili, bhakambohiki mihu ghaki, bhakuntoliki bhakahelili naku mbaka ku Gaza, bhakunkongiki pengu ja shaba, na bhakunjomalakili kuhenga lihengu la kuyagha inganu mu ligeleza heli. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Nambu majunju ghaka Samsoni ghakatumbwili kukola kabeti baada ja kumoghakeka kwaki.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Samsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Bhela ihongozi bha Bhafilisti bhakalibhongini nahuli kubhoha nyambiku kwaka chapanga wabhu Dagoni na kutenda uwangalalu, koni bhakabya bhajemba ana, “Chapanga witu Dagoni atutendiki tumuwezaje adui witu Samsoni.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Bhandu pabhakumbweni Samsoni bhakundumbalili chapanga wabhu, bhakapwaghaje, “Henu chapanga witu atutendiki tepani tunkamulaje adui witu, jola joayoningi inchi jitu na kubhakoma bhandu bhamaheli pachilanda jitu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Mitima jabhu jakabhili jihekalela namaa, bhakapwaghaje, “Mundetaje Samsoni ahika akinaje nahuli tuhekalyaje.” Panihapa bhakundetiki Samsoni kuhuma mu ligeleza mola najombi akakiniki palongi jabhu. Bhakumbekiki pachilanda ja nguzu ibheli. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samsoni akumpwaghili nkombu joakunkamwili chiwoku chaki, “Mekaje pandu ambapu nhweza kuikamula nguzu yeikamulila nyumba jenu nahuli mbataje kujeghamakela.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Nyumba jela jakabhili jitwelili bhandu akanalomi na akambomba. Bhakolongwa bhokapi bha Bhafilisti bhakabhili monihomu, na panani ja ugholu bhakabhili bhandu elufu itatu akanalomi na akambomba, bhakabhili bhundingalili Samsoni chikahi paakabhi akina.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Bhela Samsoni akundobhiki Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Bambo Chapanga nikulobha ungombukaje. Chapanga chondi umbekehi makili mala nankamu jenu pena, nahuli kwa lijambu heli mbata kulepa kisasi kwa Bhafilisti kwa ndandi ja mihu ghangu ghabheli.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Samsoni akaikamwili nguzu ibheli ya pachilanda yela ambayu nyumba jela jakabhili jichengakiki panani jaki. Akakamwili jimu chiwoku cha kumalelelu na jimu chiwoku cha kumangeja. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Samsoni akapwaghike, “Nguhaje papamu na Bhafilisti!” Panihapa akaikangiki nguzu kwa makili ghaki ghokapi. Nyumba jela jakabhahabhukili ihongozi bha Bhafilisti habha na bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhi mkati mola. Akabhakomiki bhandu bhamaheli chikahi cha kupotela kwaki kupeta chikahi cha womi waki.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Panihapa bhalongu na tati waki bhakahelili kujenda kujitola hyegha jaki. Bhakakweliki na kujitagha pachilanda ja muchi wa Sola na muchi wa Eshitaoli mu chibhanja cha kutaghila chaka Manoa tati waki. Najombi Samsoni akabhili mtemula wa Izilaeli kwa hyaka ishilini.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Himong'umong'u yaka Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Pakabhili na mundu jumu joakabhili atama ku inchi ja itombi ya Efulahimu, lihina laki akalowakiki Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Lichobha limu akumpwaghili mabhu waki, “Hipandi elufu jimu na mia jimu ya madini gha feza yeyajibhakiki kwaku, yenakajowini ukapwaghaje malobhi gha masolu kwaka mundu joakujibhile, yepambane. Nepani nde nenakajibhike, nambu sajenu ndenda kukukelabhukila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Panihapa mabhu waki akumpwaghile, “Bambo Chapanga na akupengalyaje, mwanango.” <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Mika akunkelabhukili mabhu waki hipandi elufu jimu na mia jimu ya madini gha feza, na mabhu waki akapwaghike, “Nahuli masolu ghanabhohiki ngaghakupata, nepani naghabheka madini gha feza hagha palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nahuli kulenganakela chimong'umong'u cha kubhacha na chimong'umong'u cha kuyeyusha, kwa ndandi jaku wehapa wamwanango. Henu anangubha ngati nukukelabhukila wehapa madini gha feza hagha.” <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Mika paakunkelabhukili mabhu waki hipandi ya madini gha feza yela, mabhu waki akatoliki hipandi mia ibheli ya madini gha feza na kumpekeha ndenganakela wa imong'umong'u ya kubhacha. Imong'umong'u heyi yakabhekakiki mkati ja nyumba jaka Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Bhela, Mika akabhili na pandu pa kujojabhalela ichapanga yaki, akalenganakili chizibau cha kipenganyambiku na imong'umong'u, panihapa akuntendiki mwana waki kubha mpenganyambiku waki. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Machobha ghanihagha ngachepakabhili na nkolongwa mu Izilaeli. Kila mundu akatendiki chokapi cheakaweni kubha nde chamboni pamihu jaki mweni.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Bhela chikahi chenihechi kukabhili na nkombu jumu Mlawi, akabhili atama ku muchi wa Beselehemu ku inchi ja Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Nkombu hoju akabhokiki ku Beselehemu ku inchi ja Yuda, akapiti kulonda pandu pangi pa kutama. Mu mwanja waki akahikiki kunyumba jaka Mika mu inchi ja itombi yaka Efulahimu. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika akundalukile, “Bho, wehapa uhumiki kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Najombi akayangike, “Nepani nde Mlawi kuhuma ku Betelehemu mu inchi ja Yuda, nonda pandu pa kutama.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika akumpwaghile, “Tamaje papamu na nepani, ubyaje ngati tati wangu na mpenganyambiku wangu, na nepani ananukupekyaje hipandi komi ya madini gha feza kwa chaka, ingobhu na yeipalika kwa ndandi ja matamu ghaku.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Mlawi hoju akajetakili kutama papamu na Mika, na akatemi kwaki ngati jumu wa bhana bhaka Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Najombi Mika akuntendiki nkombu Mlawi hoju kubha mpenganyambiku waki, na nkombu hoju akatemi panyumba jaka Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Panihapa Mika akapwaghike, “Sajenu manyi kubha Bambo Chapanga anaandendilaje lamboni, kwa ndandi Mlawi hoju abhi mpenganyambiku wangu.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Mika na bhandu bha likabila laka Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Bhela mu machobha ghanihagha Bhaizilaeli ngachebhakabhili na nkolongwa. Bhela bhandu bha likabila laka Dani bhakabhili bhalonda pandu pabhu bhene pa kutama, kwa ndandi bhakabhili bhakali bhalonda upwelelu wabhu pachilanda ja makabila gha Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Panihapa bhandu bha likabila laka Dani bhakabhatumiki manjolinjoli nhwanu kuhuma ku Sola na Eshitaoli nahuli bhakapelalizaje inchi heji na bhakachunguzaje. Bhandu habha bhakahaghuliki kuhuma mu lukolu lwabhu. Bhakabhapwaghile, “Njendaje mkajichunguzaje inchi heji.” Bhandu habha bhakajingili mu inchi ja hitombi yaka Efulahimu, nabhombi bhakahikiki kunyumba jaka Mika, bhakaghonili ikilu jokapi. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Pabhakabhili panyumba jaka Mika, bhakajimanyi sauti jaka nkombu Mlawi jola. Bhakunjendili na kundalukila, “Bho, nde nani joakuletiki pambane? Bho, uhenga kiki pandu pambane? Bho, ubhili na lihengu bhole pambane?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Akabhapwaghili ghala Mika ghaantendili, najombi akapwaghike, “Mika ambekihi lihengu la kubha mpenganyambiku waki.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Nabhombi bhakumpwaghile, “Chondi tukulobha utulalukyaje kwaka Chapanga, nahuli tumanyaje ngati mwanja witu anaubya wichu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Mpenganyambiku jola akabhayangike, “Njendaje kwa lukwali. Bambo Chapanga abhi papamu na mwanja winu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Bhela, bhandu nhwanu habha bhakabhokiki na kujenda ku Laishi, pandu ambapu bhakabhahimanili bhandu bhatama kwa lukwale, ngati Bhasidoni, kwa lukwali na panga choghohi. Inchi jabhu ngachejakepakiwi na chindu chokapi chela, bhela bhakabhi na hindu yamaheli. Kabheti bhakatemi kutali namaa na Bhasidoni, wala ngachebhakamulini na mundu jokapi jola.<verse eid="JDG 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Panihapa bhapalelezi nhwanu habha bhakakelawiki kwa bhalongu bhabhu ku Sola na Eshitaoli. Bhalongu bhabhu bhakabhalalukile, “Bho, mtuletili malobhi bholi kuhuma konihoko?” <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Bhombi bhakayangike, “Tujendaje tukakomanaje nabhu! Tujiweni kubha inchi nde inyahi namaa. Bho, anantamaje pambane panga kuhenga chindo? Ngamwikabhakila tujendaje tukajitendaje inchi heji kubha jitu. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Pamwijenda konihoku anamubhahimanyaje bhandu bhanga na choghohi chokapi chela. Inchi heji nde ngolongwa, ngachejikepakiwi na chindu chokapi chela, na Chapanga anjangatili kujitola inchi jeniheji.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Panihapa bhandu mia sita bha likabila laka Dani, koni bhakabya na silaha ya ngondo, bhakabhokiki kuhuma ku Sola na ku Eshitaoli na kujenda kukomana ngondo. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Bhakapiti kubheka likambi labhu ku Kiliati Yealimu mu inchi jaka Yuda. Nde ndandi upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa Kiliati Yealimu palohakeka Mahane Dani mbaka lalenu, yani Likambi laka Dani. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Kuhuma konihoku bhakapiti ku inchi ja itombi yaka Efulahimu, na kuhika kunyumba jaka Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Bhandu nhwanu bhala bhabhakapiti kujipeleleza inchi ja Laishi bhakabhapwaghili bhalongu bhabhu, “Bho, mmanyi lelu kubha jimu ja nyumba heji kubhili na chizibau, chimong'umong'u kubhacha na chimong'umong'u cha kuyeyusha? Henu muholalyaje ntundu monamwitendaje.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Panihapa bhapelelezi bhala bhakapiti kunyumba jaka Mika, bhakajingili mkati na kundamukila, na kundaluha mambu ghaka nkombu Mlawi jola. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Chikahi hechi, bhandu mia sita bha likabila laka Dani bhala, bhakabya na silaha yabhu ya ngondo, bhakajemiki pundyangu ukolongwa. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Bhandu nhwanu bhala bhabhakapiti kujipeleleza inchi bhakajingili mkati ja nyumba na bhakatoliki chimong'umong'u cha kubhacha na kuyekalewa kwa madini gha feza ghala na imong'umong'u yengi na chizibau. Chikahi hechi mpenganyambiku jola akabhili ajemiki pundyangu ukolongwa ghola papamu na bhandu mia sita bhala bhabhabhili na silaha ya ngondo.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Bhandu habha pabhakajingili mu nyumba jaka Mika na kutola chimong'umong'u cha kubhacha na kuyekalewa kwa madini gha feza ghala, chizibau, na imong'umong'u yengi, mpenganyambiku jola akabhalalukile, “Bho, muhenga kike?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Bhombi bhakumpwaghile, “Tumbalaje, kongaje ndomu waku! Uhikaje ukubha papamu na tepani, ukubhaje mundu wa kutupekeha maholalelu manyahi na mpenganyambiku witu. Au ubhona bhole? Bho, inyambiki nakanopi kwaku kubha mpenganyambiku waka mundu jumu au kubha mpenganyambiku wa likabila laku na bhalongu bhaku mu Izilaeli?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Mpenganyambiku jola akahekalili namaa. Akatoliki chizibau chela na imong'umong'u yengi na chimong'umong'u cha kubhacha, na kubhoka papamu nabhu.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Panihapa bhakatumbwi kubhoka kuhuma ku muchi waka Mika, koni bhabhalongwihi palongi bhana bhabhu bhachoku, na hinyama yabhu ya kudima na hindu yabhu. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Pabhakabhokiki na kubha patali pachokopi na nyumba jaka Mika, Mika akamanyi kubha hindu yaki itehi kutolakeka, najombi akabhalohiki bhandu bhabhakabhili pambipi na nyumba jaki na kulibhongana papamu, bhakabhajengalili bhandu bha likabila laka Dani na kubhahimanila. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Bhakabhahonili njobhela, nabhombi bhandu bha likabila laka Dani bhakang'anambwiki na kundaluki Mika, “Bho, upala kike mbaka uhika na lipogha la bhandu ntundu aghogho?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika akayangike, “Mwehapa mtoliki ichapanga yangu yenilenganakile, muntoliki na mpenganyambiku wangu, na kubhoka panga kunekela chindu chokapi chela. Bho, muweza bholi kunaluha, ‘Upala kike?’ ”<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Dani bhakumpwaghile, “Mbanga wilekaje njobhela yaku, nangabhela bhakumu bhitu bhabhabhili na inyela ikali bhaweza kukulapula, na wehapa kuhobhea matamu ghaku na matamu gha bhandu bha munyumba jaku.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Panihapa bhandu bha likabili laka Dani bhakabhokiki, najombi Mika paakaweni kubha bhandu habha bhapetalili makili kupeta jombi, akang'anambwiki na kubhuja kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Nabhombi bhandu bha likabili laka Dani habha bhakatoliki hindu yela ambayu Mika akabhili ayilenganakili, bhakuntoliki na mpenganyambiku waka Mika. Panihapa bhakahikiki ku muchi wa Laishi. Konihoku bhakabhalapwili na kubhakoma kwa mapanga bhandu bhabhatamika monihomu kwa lukwali na panga choghohi, na bhakauyoningi muchi ghonihoghu kwa moto. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Bhandu bha muchi ghonihoghu ngachebhakabhili na mundu wa kubhakengalela, kwa ndandi bhakabhili kutali na muchi wa ku Sidoni, kabheti ngachebhakabhili na upambipi na bhandu bhangi. Muchi hoghu ukabhili mu libondi pambipi na Beti Lehobu. Bhandu bha likabila laka Dani bhakauchengiki kabheti muchi ghonihoghu, na kutama monihomu. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Bhakang'anambwili lihina la muchi hoghu, bhakaulohiki Dani, kujengalela lihina laka hokolu wabhu Dani joakabhelakiki na Izilaeli, yani Yakobo. Nambu muchi hoghu pakutumbula hapa ukalowakiki Laishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Dani bhakabhekiki chimong'umong'u cha kubhacha chela, najombi Yonasani mwana waka Gelishomu, nchokolu waka Musa, papamu na bhana bhaki bhakabhili bhapenganyambiku bha likabila laka Dani mbaka bhandu bhanihabha pabhakatolakiki kwa makili kujenda ku Babeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Chikahi lihema la kunjojabhe Chapanga palakabhi ku Shilo hoku, bhandu bha likabila laka Dani bhakajojabhili chimong'umong'u cha kubhacha ambachu Mika akabhi achilenganakile.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Mlawi na lidaba laki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Bhela mu machobha ghanihagha Izilaeli ngachebhakabhili na nkolongwa. Panihapa Mlawi jumu joatamika pandu patali mu inchi ja hitombi ya Efulahimu, akatoliki lidaba limu kuhuma ku muchi wa Beselehemu mu inchi ja Yuda, <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />nambu lidaba waki akakosiki ulongwana na kuhenga ukemi kunja jaka Mlawi hoju, najombi akundekiki abhujaje kunyumba jaka tati waki ku Beselehemu mu inchi ja Yuda. Akatemi konihoku kwa chikahi cha myehi nchechi. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Lichobha limu ndomi waki akapiti kundobha nahuli akelabhukaje. Akapiti na mtumika waki na maponda ghabheli. Mbomba jola akunjopalili na kumpeleka mkati ja nyumba jaka tati waki, tati waki paakumbweni akunjopalili kwa chiheku. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Panihapa nkohanu waki, yani tati waka kamwali jola, akundobhiki nahuli atamaje, najombi Mlawi jola papamu na mtumika waki bhakatemi machobha ghatatu, bhakakulaji na kunywa na kughonela konihoku. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Lichobha la kachechi bhakajumwiki lukela pachibhombu na kuliandaa kubhoka, nambu tati waka mbomba jola akumpwaghi nkohanu waki, “Kula hoti chilebhi nahuli upataje makili na ujendaje na mwanja waku.”<verse eid="JDG 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Panihapa bhakatemi bhokapi bhabheli nahuli kula na kunywa papamu. Tati waka mbomba jola akumpwaghile, “Chondi nukulobha ughonila pambane ikilu jenu na kuhekalela.”<verse eid="JDG 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Bhela, mundu jola paakajemiki nahuli kubhoka, tati waka mbomba jola akumpembalili nahuli ahighalyaje ikilu jela, najombi akahighalili konihoku kabheti. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Lukela lichobha la kahanu, paakajumwiki nahuli abhokaje, tati waka mbomba jola akumpwaghile, “Chondi nukulobha, ukula hoti nahuli upata makili, ulendalyaje mbaka lyobha likepaje, panihapa wibhokaje.” Nabhombi bhokapi bhabheli bhakakuliki chilebhi papamu.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Mlawi na lidaba waki papamu na mtumika waki pabhakajemiki nahuli kubhoka, tati waka mbamba jola akumpwaghile, “Lingalyaje, sajenu chimihi chiheghalile. Ughonila pambane ikilu uheghalile. Utama, uhekalyaje. Chilabhu lukela pachibhombu ujumukaje, na kutumbula mwanja wa kubhuja kunyumba jaku.”<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Nambu mundu hoju akakaniki kughonela kabheti panipala ikilu jenijela, akabhokiki na kujenda mbaka ku Yebusi, yani Yelusalemu, akabya na maponda ghaki ghabheli ghaghatandakiki wichu, papamu na lidaba laki. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Pabhakabhili pambipi na Yebusi na ikilu ukabhili uheghalile, mtumika akumpwaghili bambo waki, “Mbanga tujingalaje mu muchi wa Yebusi hoghu tughonilaje monihomo.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Nambu nkolongwa akumpwaghile, “Ngatwing'ambuki kujingila mu muchi wa chigheni, ambau bandu bhaki nga Bhaizilaeli. Anatujendalyaje mbaka tuhikaje ku Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Akumpwaghili mtumika waki, tukangamalaje tukahika ku Gibea au ku Lama, na tepani anatughonilaje mu muchi ghumu waki.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Panihapa bhakajendalili na mwanja wabhu mbaka lyobha lakajibhili pabhakabhili pambipi na muchi wa Gibea, ambau nde muchi wa likabila laka Benyamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Bhakajingili mu muchi ghonihoghu na kujenda kutama mu lubhanja lwa palanga lwa muchi, kwa ndandi ngacheakabhili mundu joakabhajopalili na kujenda kughonela kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Pabhakabhili konihoku mzee jumu akahikiki kuhuma kungonda jaki. Mzee hoju akabhi mwenehi wa inchi ja hitombi ya Efulaimu na akabhi atama ku Gibea ngati ngeni. Bhandu bha muchi wa Gibea bhakabhili bha likabila laka Benyamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Mzee hoju paakabhaweni bhatenda mwanja habha mu chibhanja cha muchi, akabhalalukile, “Bho, mwehapa muhuma kwaku? Na njenda kwako?”<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Akamuyangike, “Tupeta tuhuma ku Beselehemu jaka Yuda, tujenda mu inchi ja hitombi jaka Efulaimu, konihoku nde konitamaje. Nakapiti ku Beselehemu jaka Yuda, na sajenu nyenda kunyumba jangu pandu paajojabhalewa Bambo Chapanga. Nga mundu jokapi jola joanyopalili na kumbeleka kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Tubhili na manyonyoli na chilebhi cha maponda ghitu na libumunda na divai kwa ndandi jitu na bhatumika bhaku yani nepani, mtumika wangu wa chimbomba, papamu na mtumika wangu jotulongini naku joni. Ngachetupala chindu chokapi chela.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Mzee jola akabhapwaghile, “Lukwali lubya na mwenga! Tujendaje kunyumba jango. Ananumpekyaje chokapi chela chemkepakiwi, nambu ngamwighonela mu chibhanja chenu cha muchi.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Panihapa hokomundu jola akabhapeliki kunyumba jaki na kughapekeha maponda ghabhu chilebhi. Na bhagheni bhala bhakagholwilli magholu ghabhu kwa machi, bhakakuliki na kunywa.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Pabhakabhili bhahekalela, palapala bhandu bhahakau bha muchi hoghu, bhakahikiki na kujiyongolota nyumba jaka hokomundu jola. Bhakahoniki ndyangu na kumpwaghila hokomundu mweni nyumba jola, “Umpiha kunja mundu jola joajingili mu nyumba jaku, nahuli tughonila naku.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Nambu hokomundu mweni nyumba jola akapitiki kunja, na kubhapwaghila, “Ngamwatenda bhenibhela bhalongu bhango, mpepakoku ngamwatenda uhakau hoghu. Jonihoju nde ngeni wangu, ngamwanhengela lijambu heli la iyoni. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Njowanyaje, kamwali wangu abhi pambane, nde kamwali jwangakummanya mwanalomi, na lidaba laka mundu hoju, ananabhapihaje kunja koni, henu mwehapa nhweza kubhatola na kubhatendela ghanihagha ghamughabhona kubha nde ghamboni, nambu mundu hoju ngamwanhengela lijambu la chihakau hele.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Nambu bhandu bhala ngachebhunjowanili. Panihapa Mlawi jola akumpihiki lidaba laki kunja kwa bhandu bhala, nabhombi bhakuntoliki na kughone naku kwa makili na kuntendela mambu gha iyoni ikilu jokapi mbaka lukela. Pakwatumbula kunang'ana bhakundekiki ajendaje.<verse eid="JDG 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Lukela mbomba jola akahikiki mbaka pundyangu wa nyumba jeakabhi bambo waki, akahawiki pahi pundyangu hapa na kutama panihapa mbaka pachibhombu.<verse eid="JDG 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Bhela bambo waki paakajumwiki lukela na kuhogho ndyangu wa nyumba na kupita kunja nahuli ajendalyaje na mwanja waki, palapala akunhimani lidaba laki aghonile pahi pundyangu, mabhoku ghaki ghakamulakili ngelaketi ya ndyangu. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Akumpwaghi lidaba jola, “Jemaje, tujendaje.” Nambu jombi ngacheakayangiki chindu. Bhela bambu jola akunjukwihi na kunkweha panani ja liponda laki, akabhokiki na kujenda naku kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Paakahikiki kunyumba jaki akatoliki mpamba na kunheketa lidaba jola hipandi komi na ibheli. Panihapa akaipeliki hipandi heyi pandu pokapi mu kila likabila la inchi ja Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Kila mundu joakaliweni lijambu heli akapwaghike, “Lijambu la ntundu hoghu ngachelibhonakini wala kuhengakeka, kutumbula Izilaeli pabhakakweliki kuhuma ku Misili. Tuholalyaje kubhokana na ntundu wa kulihengela lihengu lijambu leniheli!”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhaliandaa kwa ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhokapi kutumbula ku inchi jaka Dani mbaka ku Beeli Sheba, papamu na bhandu bha inchi ja Gileadi bhakabhokiki ngati mundu jumu na kulibhongana palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga ku Misipa hoku. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Ihongozi bhokapi bha makabila gha Izilaeli bhakahikiki palongi ja uhimanganu wa bhandu bhaka Chapanga. Bhakabhi manjolinjoli laki nchechi bhabhajenda kwa magholu koni bhatotwili mapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini, bhakapatiki utenga kubha bhandu bhangi Bhaizilaeli bhajabhu bhakweliki kujenda ku Misipa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:3">Bhela panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhakapwaghike, “Mutupwaghilaje ntundu lijambu lihakau heli lihengakiki bhole?” <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Mlawi jola, ndomi waka mbomba jola joakakomakiki, akapwaghike, “Nepani na lidaba langu tukahikiki ku Gibea muchi wa likabila laka Benyamini, nahuli tughonilaje konihoku ikilu. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Chikahi cha ikilu bhandu bha ku Gibea bhakahikiki na kujiyongolota nyumba monakabhi ng'onile, bhakapaliki kungoma. Bhakundimbiki lidaba langu mbaka kupotela. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Panihapa nakajitoliki hyegha jaka lidaba langu, nakunhekiti hipandi hipandi na kujipeleka kwa makabili ghokapi gha Izilaeli, maghambu bhatendiki lijambu la kuhakaliha na lijambu la iyoni mu inchi ja Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Bhela, mwehapa Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, mpwaghaje na mbohaje utemulu winu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Bhandu bhokapi bhakajumwiki bhakapwaghaje ngati mundu jumu, “Njeta mundu jokapi pachilanda jitu jonaakelabhukaje mu lihema laki, wala njeta mundu jokapi joanajendaje kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Anana nde moanatubhahengilaje bhandu bha ku Gibea: Anatulapulaje kula ja ntundu wa kubhalapula. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Anatutolaje bhandu komi mu kila bhandu mia moja bha Izilaeli, bhandu mia moja mu kila bhandu elufu jimu, bhandu elufu jimu mu kila bhandu elufu komi. Bhanihabha anabhakubhaje na lihengu la kubhaletela chilebhi bhajabhu pabhikubhaje na lihengu la kuulapula muchi wa Gibea mu inchi jaka Benyamini kwa uhakau wabhu na iyoni jebhatendiki mu inchi ja Izilaeli.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Bhela akanalomi bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakahimangini papamu, na kulilomba ngati mundu jumu kujenda kubhalapula bhandu bha muchi wa Gibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Makabila gha Izilaeli ghakatumiki bhandu kujenda mu pandu pabhatama likabila lokapi laka Benyamini na kupwagha, “Bho, nde uhakau bhole wa kujoghuheka ghoutendakiki pachilanda jinu? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Henu mutupekyaje bhandu bhahakau bha Gibea habha nahuli tubhakomaje na kubhoha uhakau mu Izilaeli.” Nambu bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini ngachebhakabhajowanili bhalongu bhabhu Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini bhakabhokiki mu michi jabhu, bhakalibhongini ku Gibea nahuli kukomana na Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini bhakalibhongini kuhuma mu michi jabhu, linjolinjoli la bhandu elufu ishilini na sita bhabhatumila mapanga, nabhombi bhandu bha muchi wa Gibea bhakalibhongini bhandu mia saba bhabhamanyi kukomana wichu. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Pachilanda ja manjolinjoli bhokapi bhabhahaghuliwi habha, kukabhili na manjolinjoli mia saba bhabhatumilaje chiwoku cha kumangeja, kila jumu akaweziki kulenga liganga kwa ngumbila na kulenga lijunju panga kukosa. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Nabhombi Bhaizilaeli bhangi, patali na likabila laka Benyamini, bhakabhabhongini bhandu akanalomi laki nchechi bhabhaweza kutumila mapanga, bhokapi habha bhakabhi wichu kwa kukomana ngondo.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaizilaeli bhakomana na likabila laka Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Bhaizilaeli bhakapiti ku Beseli na kundaluki Chapanga, “Bho, nde nane pachilanda jitu jonalongulyaje palongi jitu nahuli kukomana na likabila laka Benyamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Bambo Chapanga akabhayangike, “Yuda nde jonaalongulyaje.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakabhokiki chilabhu jaki lukela, bhakabhekiki likambi labhu pambipi na muchi wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Bhaizilaeli bhakabhokiki na kujema kila mundu pandu paki nahuli kukomana na bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini pambipi na Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Bhandu bha likabila laka Bhenyamini bhakapitiki kunja ja muchi wa Gibea na kukomana na Bhaizilaeli, Bhaizilaeli elufu ishilini na ibheli bhakakomakiki mu lichobha leniheli. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Nambu Bhaizilaeli bhakajeghalini mtima kila jumu na njaki, bhakalipangiki kabhete kwa ngondo pandu pala pabhakalipangiki pakutumbula. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Mangani ja ghanihagha, Bhaizilaeli bhakapiti palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga na kulela palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga mbaka pakamihi, nabhombi bhakundaluki Bambo Chapanga bhakapwaghaje, “Bho, tujenda le kabheti kukomana ngondo na bhalongu bhitu Bhabenyamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Bambo Chapanga akabhayangike, “Nkwelaje mkakomana nabhu.” <verse eid="JDG 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Lichobha la kabheli Bhaizilaeli bhakabhaheghalili nahuli kukomana na bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Lichobha la kabheli heli bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini bhakabhokiti ku Gibea na kukomana na Bhaizilaeli, bhakabhakomiki manjolinjoli elufu komi na nane gha Bhaizilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhokapi, bhakapiti ku Beseli, lichobha leniheli bhakatami konihoku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga bhakalelaje. Bhakatami panga kula chindu mbaka pakamihi na kubhoha nyambiku ja kujochakeka na nyambiku ja lukwali kwaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Nabhombi Bhaizilaeli bhakundalukili Bambo Chapanga. Mu lichobha heli lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Chapanga lakabili ku Beseli hoku, <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />na Finehasi mwana waka Eleazali, nchokolu waka Haluni, akabhi ajemiki palongi ja lisanduku heli chikahi hechi. Bhaizilaeli bhakumpwaghi Finehasi alalukyaje kwaka Bambo Chapanga, “Bho, tukwela le kujenda kukomana kabheti na Bhabenyamini bhalongu bhitu, au ngatwikwela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Bambo Chapanga akabhayangike, “Njendaje, chilabhu ananuntenda mubhaweza bhandu bhanihabha.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhakabhabhekiki manjolinjoli bha kujobhalela kuyongolota muchi wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Bhaizilaeli bhakapiti kukomana na bhandu bha likabila laka Bhenyamini mu lichobha la katatu. Bhakalipangiki wichu nahuli kukomana na bhandu bha Gibea, ngati mobhakatendili pakutumbula hapa. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Bhela Bhabenyamini bhakabhokiki nahuli kukomana nabhu, Bhaizilaeli bhakabhahutiki Bhabenyamini bhabhokaje mu muchi. Bhakatumbwili kukomana na kubhakoma Bhaizilaeli selasini, ngati mobhakatendiki pakutumbula, mu indela ngolongwa, jimu jejijenda ku Beseli na jengi ku Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Bhabhenjamini bhakapwagha, “Bhalapuliki palongi jitu ngati pakutumbula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:32">Nambu Bhaizilaeli bhakapwaghiki, “Tepani tutilaje nahuli tubhahutaje bhaulekaje muchi bhajendaje kuindela ngolongwa.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Manjolinjoli bhokapi bha Bhaizilaei pabhakahikiki ku Baali Tamali bhakatehi kujema, na kulipanga kabheti pandu pabhu nahuli kukomana ngondo, chikahi chenihechi manjolinjoli bha kujobhalela bha Bhaizilaeli bhala bhakapitalili manyata pandu panihapa ku upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha wa muchi wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Manjolinjoli elufu komi bhabhamanyi kukomana ngondo wichu bhabhahaghuliki kuhuma mu makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli, bhakahikiki kubhalapula bhandu bha muchi wa Gibea. Ngondo jakabhi ngolongwa namaa. Nambu bhandu bhaka Bhenyamini ngachebhakamanyi kubha kuyonangeka kwabhu kukabhi pambipi namaa. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Bambo Chapanga akabhaweziki Bhabenyanimi palongi ja Bhaizilaeli na lichobha lenilela Bhaizilaeli bhakabhakomiki Bhabenyamini manjolinjoli elufu ishilini na nhwanu na mia jimu, bhokapi habha bhakabhi manjolinjoli bhabhaweza kutumi mapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Bhela Bhabenyamini bhakaweni kubha bhalapuliki.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JDG 20:36">Ntundu Bhaizilaeli mobhakabhalapulile Bhabenyamini</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhakabhi bhabhokiki palongi ja Bhabenyamini, kwa ndandi Bhaizilaeli bhakabhi bhabhahobhalela bhabhajobhalela bhabhakabhi bhabhekakiki kuujobhalela muchi wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Bhabhajobhalela bhala bhakatendiki manyata kuulapula muchi wa Gibea na kubhakoma bhokapi bhabhakabhi monihomu kwa mapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Manjolinjoli bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakajetangani na manjolinjoli bhala bhabhakajobhalili kuuyongolota muchi, na kubheka nginyulila. Bhakajetanganili kubha bhala bhabhajobhalela pabhijingala mu muchi bhapambakya moto nahuli lyohi laki likwelaje kunani kuhuma mu muchi ghobihogho ngati lihundi, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />nabhombi bhandu Bhaizilaeli bhakang'anambwiki kukomana. Manjolinjoli bhaka Benyamini bhakabhi tayali bhatumbwi kubhalapula na kubhakoma bhandu selasini bha Izilaeli, panihapa bhakaholalile, “Chakaka anatubhalapulaje ngati motukabhawezili mu ngondo pakutumbula hapa.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Nambu chikahi lihundi la lyohi lela palatumbulaje kukwela kuhuma mu muchi ghola, Bhabenyamini bhakang'anambwiki kunyuma bhakakangichi kubhona kubha muchi wabhu ukabhi uyonangeka kwa moto. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhakang'anambwiki, na bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini bhakakamuliki na lujoghopu, maghambu bhakaweni kubha kuyonangeka kwabhu kuheghalile. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Bhela Bhabenyamini bhakang'anambwiki na kubhatila Bhaizilaeli kujenda kulipololu, nambu ngachebhakaweziki kujepa ngondo jenijela. Nabhombi Bhaizilaeli bhabhakabhokiki mu michi jenijela bhakabhakomiki konihoku. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Bhaizilaeli bhakabhalapwi bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini kuhuma ku ipambala yokapi na kubhatopola, na kubhakoma panihapa pabhakabhili bhapomulili, mu upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa muchi wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Lichoba leniheli bhakabhakomiki manjolinjoli ghaghamanyi kukomana ngondu wichu elufu komi na nane bha likabila laka Benyamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Bhandu bhangi bha likabila laka Benyamini bhakang'anambwiki na bhakatiliki kujenda kuchingwenji mbaka kulihikila litalaghu la Limoni, Bhaizilaeli bhakabhakomiki bhandu elufu nhwanu bhakabya mwindela. Bhakabhajengalili kwa manyata mbaka ku Gidomu, na konihoku bhakabhakomiki bhandu bhangi elufu ibheli. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Ubhalangiku wa bhandu bhokapi bhabhakomakiki mu lichobha leniheli bhakabhi bhandu elufu ishilini na nhwanu, bhokapi bhakabhi manjolinjoli bhabhamanyi kukomana ngondu wichu.<verse eid="JDG 20:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Nambu akanalomi mia sita bha likabila laka Benyamini bhakaweziki kutilila kuchingwenji mbaka kulitalaghhu la Limoni, bhakatami konihoku kwa chikahi cha myehi nchechi. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Bhaizilaeli bhakakelawiki kabhete kwa bhandu bhangi bha likabila laka Benyamini, na kubhakoma bhokapi: Akanalomi, akambomba, bhana na hinyama. Na michi jokapi jebhakajihimanili konihoku bhakajijochiki kwa moto.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Akabhahanu kwa ndandi ja likabila la Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakalibhongini na kulapa ku Misipa: “Nga mundu jokapi joanaantoghukyaje kamwali waki kwa likabila laka Benyamini.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Pajapetiki ngondu jeniheji, bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakapiti ku Beseli, bhakatami palongi jaka Chapanga mbaka chimihi, bhakajamalili na kulela namaa. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Bhakapwaghike, “Bambo Chapanga wa Izilaeli, bho, kwa ndandi kiki lijambu heli libhapatiki Bhaizilaeli? Bho, kwa ndandi kiki likabila limu la Izilaeli lihobhaje?”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Chilabhu jaki lukela pachibhombu bhandu bhakachengiki pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku na kuleta nyambiku ja kujochakeka na nyambiku ja lukwali. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Panihapa Bhaizilaeli bhakalaluhine, “Bho, nde likabila laleku la Izilaeli ambalu ngachelihikiki mu uhimanganu ghoutendakiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga?” Kwa ndandi bhakabhekiki chilapu chikolongwa kubha jokapi jwangakuhika palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga ku Misipa, chakaka akomakakije. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Nambu Bhaizilaeli bhakabhabhonili chiha bhalongu bhabhu bha likabila laka Benyamini, bhakapwaghaje, “Lalenu likabila limu la Izilaeli liyonangike. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Bho, henu tutenda kiki nahuli kubhapekeha akabhahanu, kwa akanalomi bha likabila laka Benyamini bhabhahighalile? Maghambu tukajomwili kulapa kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga kubha ngatubhapekehi akakamwali bhitu kubha bhahanu bhabhu.”<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Panihapa bhakapwaghike, “Bho, nde likabila laleku la Izilaeli ambalu ngachelakahikiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga ku Misipa?” Bhakamanyiki kubha njeta mundu hata jumu joakahumiki ku Yabeshi Gileadi joakahikiki mu uhimanganu hoghu. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Pabhakatendiki ubhalangiku bhandu bhakaweni kubha nga mundu jokapi wa ku Yabeshi Gileadi joakabhile. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Panihapa uhimanganu bhakatumiki manjolinjoli bhabhamanyi kukomana ngondo wichu elufu komi na ibheli na kubhalaghalakila, “Njendaje mkabhakomaje bhandu bha ku Yabeshi Gileadi, akambomba papamu na bhana. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Bhakapwaghike: Leniheli nde lemwitendaje. Mubhakomaje kila mundu mwanalomi na mbomba jwangakubha kamwali lenda.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Bhakabhahimanili akakamwali lenda mia nne bha ku Yabeshi Gileadi ambabhu ngachebhalabhalili kughonela na akanalomi, bhakabhapeliki kulikambi ku Shilo hoku mu inchi ja Kanaani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Panihapa uhimanganu ukatumiki utenga wa lukwali, kwa bhandu bha likabila laka Bhenjamini ambabhu bhakabhili ku litalaghu la Limoni. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Bhela bha Bhabenyamini bhakabhujiki kunyumba yabhu, kuhuma kulitalaghu la Limoni, bhakapekiwi akakamwali lenda bha Yabeshi Gileadi bhabhakakengaliwi. Nambu ngachebhaghanili akanalomi bhokapi.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Bhaizilaeli bhakabhabhonili chiha bhandu bha likabila laka Benyamini, maghambu Bambo Chapanga akahighali pachokopi pela kulihobheha likabila laka Benyamini mu inchi ja Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Ihongozi bha uhimanganu bhakapwaghike, “Kwa kubha akambomba bha likabila laka Benyamini bhatehi kuyonangeka, bho, tutenda kiki nahuli kubhapekeha akambomba akanalomi bhala bhabhakosike? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Bhakapwaghike, kubha ipalika kubhapekeha bhakambomba akanalomi bha likabila laka Benyamini bhabhahighalili nahuli bhajendelizaje likabila, na bhela ngalihobha likabila lokapi mu Izilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Ngatuwezi kubhapekeha akakamwali bhitu kubha bhahanu bhabhu, kwa ndandi tepani Bhaizilaeli tulapiki chilapu chenjenu, ‘Apataje masolu mundu jokapi joanaampekyaje mbomba, mwanalomi wa likabila laka Benyamini.’ ” <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Panihapa bhakapwaghiki, “Nkombukaje kubha kubhi na uwangalalu wa kila chaka kwaka Bambo Chapanga mu Shilo, kungondi ja Beseli na kolipita lyobha wa indela jela jejihuma ku Beseli kujenda ku Shekemu, upambala wa kunkachi wa Lebona.” <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Bhakabhalaghalakili Bhabenyamini bhakapwaghaje, “Njendaje mkajobhalyaje mu mighonda ja mizabibu, <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />na mwehapa mlilingalyaje. Akakamwali bha Shilo pabhipita kunja kukina chakahi cha uhangalalu, mpitanyaje mu mighonda ja mizabibu na kila mundu antolaje kamwali jumu abyaje nhwanu waki. Panihapa nkelabhukaje mu inchi jaka Benyamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Akatati bhabhu au bhalongu bhabhu akanalomi pabhihikaje kutung'ong'utakela, anatubhapwaghilaje, ‘Tepani tundobha mubhabhonila chiha bhandu bhaka Benyamini na mwabhalekilaje bhabhatolaje akambomba bhanihabha, maghambu ngachetukabhapekihi akabhahanu kuhuma mu ngondu ja ku Yabeshi Gileadi. Nambu wehapa mabheni ngachemwapekihi akakamwali bhinu habha, panihapa ngamwitemuliwe.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Akanalomi bha likabila laka Benyamini bhakatendiki bhenibhela, kila jumu akahawili kamwali pachilanda ja akakamwali bhabhakapitiki kunja kukina ku Shilo hoku na kuntola kubha nhwanu waki. Panihapa bhakakelawiki mu inchi jabhu na kujichenga michi jabhu kubha jahenu na kutama monihomu. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Chikahi chenihechi Bhaizilaeli bhakabhokiki pandu pala na kujenda kumanyumba ghabhu, mu makabila ghabhu na kwa bhandu bhabhu, kila jumu mu pandu paakapekiwi kubha paki.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Mu machobha ghanihagha ngachepakabhili na nkolongwa mu Izilaeli. Kila mundu akatendiki ngati moakabhonili kubha nde wichu pamihu jaki mweni.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>